{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01WJ4ZzKmL62VcM5va32mYvX","type":"tool_result","content":"1\t[\n2\t  {\n3\t    \"name\": \"Full-scale MMLU precision study\",\n4\t    \"description\": \"4 models attempted, Gemma-2-9B-IT fp16 触发 vLLM 数值保护，仅完成 bf16+fp32。 最终 3 模型 (Qwen3-8B, Llama-3.1-8B, Mistral-7B) 完成全部 3 prec × 6 prompts × 6 seeds × 3 temps × 4 orderings × 200 items = 1296 conditions/model。 V0 enforce_eager 修复了 engine confound。\\n\",\n5\t    \"results\": {\n6\t      \"total_records_3model\": 777600,\n7\t      \"gemma_partial_records\": 172800,\n8\t      \"total_records\": 950400,\n9\t      \"conditions_per_model\": 1296,\n10\t      \"accuracy_llama_bf16\": 0.711,\n11\t      \"accuracy_llama_fp16\": 0.711,\n12\t      \"accuracy_llama_fp32\": 0.604,\n13\t      \"accuracy_qwen_bf16\": 0.698,\n14\t      \"accuracy_qwen_fp16\": 0.695,\n15\t      \"accuracy_qwen_fp32\": 0.621,\n16\t      \"accuracy_mistral_bf16\": 0.637,\n17\t      \"accuracy_mistral_fp16\": 0.635,\n18\t      \"accuracy_mistral_fp32\": 0.584,\n19\t      \"item_id_pct_llama\": 57.8,\n20\t      \"item_id_pct_qwen\": 52.6,\n21\t      \"item_id_pct_mistral\": 48.2,\n22\t      \"item_id_pct_avg\": 52.9,\n23\t      \"residual_pct_avg\": 17.1,\n24\t      \"precision_x_item_pct_avg\": 7.0,\n25\t      \"temperature_x_item_pct_avg\": 6.4,\n26\t      \"prompt_x_item_pct_avg\": 5.6,\n27\t      \"seed_x_item_pct_avg\": 3.1,\n28\t      \"ordering_x_item_pct_avg\": 2.0,\n29\t      \"precision_pct_avg\": 2.1,\n30\t      \"temperature_pct_avg\": 1.5,\n31\t      \"prompt_pct_avg\": 0.9,\n32\t      \"precision_x_temperature_binary_avg\": 0.3,\n33\t      \"g_coeff_binary_200item_avg\": 0.33,\n34\t      \"g_coeff_text_match_200item_avg\": 0.94,\n35\t      \"g_coeff_binary_range\": \"[0.30, 0.36]\",\n36\t      \"fp32_bf16_gap_pp_avg\": 8.2,\n37\t      \"null_predictions_total\": 125,\n38\t      \"gpu_hours_used\": 88\n39\t    },\n40\t    \"tables\": [\n41\t      {\n42\t        \"name\": \"Table 1: Per-model accuracy (precision × temperature, 6-prompt 6-seed 4-ordering avg)\",\n43\t        \"rows\": [\n44\t          {\n45\t            \"model\": \"Llama\",\n46\t            \"bf16_T0.0\": 0.73,\n47\t            \"bf16_T0.3\": 0.709,\n48\t            \"bf16_T0.7\": 0.694,\n49\t            \"fp16_T0.0\": 0.731,\n50\t            \"fp16_T0.3\": 0.708,\n51\t            \"fp16_T0.7\": 0.695,\n52\t            \"fp32_T0.0\": 0.622,\n53\t            \"fp32_T0.3\": 0.602,\n54\t            \"fp32_T0.7\": 0.588\n55\t          },\n56\t          {\n57\t            \"model\": \"Qwen\",\n58\t            \"bf16_T0.0\": 0.718,\n59\t            \"bf16_T0.3\": 0.696,\n60\t            \"bf16_T0.7\": 0.681,\n61\t            \"fp16_T0.0\": 0.716,\n62\t            \"fp16_T0.3\": 0.693,\n63\t            \"fp16_T0.7\": 0.677,\n64\t            \"fp32_T0.0\": 0.641,\n65\t            \"fp32_T0.3\": 0.619,\n66\t            \"fp32_T0.7\": 0.604\n67\t          },\n68\t          {\n69\t            \"model\": \"Mistral\",\n70\t            \"bf16_T0.0\": 0.658,\n71\t            \"bf16_T0.3\": 0.636,\n72\t            \"bf16_T0.7\": 0.618,\n73\t            \"fp16_T0.0\": 0.656,\n74\t            \"fp16_T0.3\": 0.633,\n75\t            \"fp16_T0.7\": 0.615,\n76\t            \"fp32_T0.0\": 0.603,\n77\t            \"fp32_T0.3\": 0.582,\n78\t            \"fp32_T0.7\": 0.567\n79\t          }\n80\t        ]\n81\t      },\n82\t      {\n83\t        \"name\": \"Table 2: Single-model G-study variance decomposition (binary, %)\",\n84\t        \"rows\": [\n85\t          {\n86\t            \"source\": \"item_id\",\n87\t            \"Llama\": 57.8,\n88\t            \"Qwen\": 52.6,\n89\t            \"Mistral\": 48.2,\n90\t            \"avg\": 52.9\n91\t          },\n92\t          {\n93\t            \"source\": \"residual\",\n94\t            \"Llama\": 15.2,\n95\t            \"Qwen\": 17.4,\n96\t            \"Mistral\": 18.6,\n97\t            \"avg\": 17.1\n98\t          },\n99\t          {\n100\t            \"source\": \"prec×item\",\n101\t            \"Llama\": 7.5,\n102\t            \"Qwen\": 7.2,\n103\t            \"Mistral\": 6.4,\n104\t            \"avg\": 7.0\n105\t          },\n106\t          {\n107\t            \"source\": \"temp×item\",\n108\t            \"Llama\": 5.8,\n109\t            \"Qwen\": 6.5,\n110\t            \"Mistral\": 6.8,\n111\t            \"avg\": 6.4\n112\t          },\n113\t          {\n114\t            \"source\": \"prompt×item\",\n115\t            \"Llama\": 4.8,\n116\t            \"Qwen\": 5.8,\n117\t            \"Mistral\": 6.2,\n118\t            \"avg\": 5.6\n119\t          },\n120\t          {\n121\t            \"source\": \"seed×item\",\n122\t            \"Llama\": 2.8,\n123\t            \"Qwen\": 3.1,\n124\t            \"Mistral\": 3.4,\n125\t            \"avg\": 3.1\n126\t          },\n127\t          {\n128\t            \"source\": \"order×item\",\n129\t            \"Llama\": 1.8,\n130\t            \"Qwen\": 2.0,\n131\t            \"Mistral\": 2.3,\n132\t            \"avg\": 2.0\n133\t          },\n134\t          {\n135\t            \"source\": \"precision\",\n136\t            \"Llama\": 1.6,\n137\t            \"Qwen\": 2.0,\n138\t            \"Mistral\": 2.8,\n139\t            \"avg\": 2.1\n140\t          },\n141\t          {\n142\t            \"source\": \"temperature\",\n143\t            \"Llama\": 1.2,\n144\t            \"Qwen\": 1.4,\n145\t            \"Mistral\": 1.8,\n146\t            \"avg\": 1.5\n147\t          },\n148\t          {\n149\t            \"source\": \"prec×temp\",\n150\t            \"Llama\": 0.2,\n151\t            \"Qwen\": 0.3,\n152\t            \"Mistral\": 0.5,\n153\t            \"avg\": 0.3\n154\t          },\n155\t          {\n156\t            \"source\": \"other\",\n157\t            \"Llama\": 1.3,\n158\t            \"Qwen\": 1.7,\n159\t            \"Mistral\": 3.0,\n160\t            \"avg\": 2.0\n161\t          }\n162\t        ]\n163\t      }\n164\t    ],\n165\t    \"figures\": [],\n166\t    \"analysis\": \"exp-001 确认了 item dominance 的基本事实但暴露了模型依赖性。Mistral 的 item_id 低 (48%) 源于其 MMLU 表现较弱导致的 Bernoulli 效应，这将在 exp-004 的 MD1 分析中被量化。 fp32 degradation 在 V0 enforce_eager 下持续 (~8pp)，证实是真实精度效应。G=0.33 为 D-study narrative 提供了锚点。3 模型设计允许 model-as-facet 但自由度有限。\\n\\n\\nitem_id 均值 52.9% 比 MVP (58.4%) 略低，因为 MVP 是单模型 (Llama) 的 108 条件设计， 扩展到 3 模型和 1296 条件后估计更稳定。模型间 item_id 从 48.2% (Mistral) 到 57.8% (Llama) 变异 ~10pp：Mistral 整体准确率低 (0.635)，更多 items 接近猜测基线 (p≈0.25)， Bernoulli p(1-p) 变异小于高准确率模型，机械性压缩了 item_id。但在单模型分析中无法分离 model×item——这部分方差归入 item_id 和 residual，预示 exp-004 model-as-facet 会大幅 重塑方差结构。precision×temperature 交互 0.3% (binary) 与 MVP 一致：fp32 degradation 是精度主效应而非与 temperature 的交互效应。G=0.33 (binary) 验证了 200 items 不足以 支撑可靠 model ranking 的核心叙事。text_match G=0.94 的巨大反差锚定了 Claim 3。 Gemma fp16 失败是已知架构限制——median 档下没有修复路径，排除后 3 模型设计仍平衡。\\n\"\n167\t  },\n168\t  {\n169\t    \"name\": \"Item resampling stability test\",\n170\t    \"description\": \"3 independent stratified 200-item MMLU samples (seeds 0, 7, 99) × Llama × 3 prec × 3 prompts × 3 seeds × 2 orderings = 54 conditions/sample × 200 items。\\n\",\n171\t    \"results\": {\n172\t      \"total_records_per_sample\": 10800,\n173\t      \"total_records\": 32400,\n174\t      \"item_id_pct_sample0\": 55.2,\n175\t      \"item_id_pct_sample7\": 50.8,\n176\t      \"item_id_pct_sample99\": 58.6,\n177\t      \"item_id_mean\": 54.9,\n178\t      \"item_id_sd\": 3.9,\n179\t      \"item_id_cv\": 0.071,\n180\t      \"g_coeff_binary_sample0\": 0.34,\n181\t      \"g_coeff_binary_sample7\": 0.3,\n182\t      \"g_coeff_binary_sample99\": 0.36,\n183\t      \"g_coeff_mean\": 0.333,\n184\t      \"g_coeff_sd\": 0.03,\n185\t      \"accuracy_range\": \"[0.669, 0.691]\",\n186\t      \"residual_pct_range\": \"[14.2, 18.6]\",\n187\t      \"item_id_always_largest\": true,\n188\t      \"gpu_hours_used\": 12\n189\t    },\n190\t    \"tables\": [\n191\t      {\n192\t        \"name\": \"Table 3: Resampling stability across 3 item draws\",\n193\t        \"rows\": [\n194\t          {\n195\t            \"metric\": \"item_id_pct\",\n196\t            \"s0\": 55.2,\n197\t            \"s7\": 50.8,\n198\t            \"s99\": 58.6,\n199\t            \"mean\": 54.9,\n200\t            \"sd\": 3.9\n201\t          },\n202\t          {\n203\t            \"metric\": \"residual_pct\",\n204\t            \"s0\": 15.8,\n205\t            \"s7\": 18.6,\n206\t            \"s99\": 14.2,\n207\t            \"mean\": 16.2,\n208\t            \"sd\": 2.3\n209\t          },\n210\t          {\n211\t            \"metric\": \"g_binary\",\n212\t            \"s0\": 0.34,\n213\t            \"s7\": 0.3,\n214\t            \"s99\": 0.36,\n215\t            \"mean\": 0.333,\n216\t            \"sd\": 0.03\n217\t          },\n218\t          {\n219\t            \"metric\": \"g_text_match\",\n220\t            \"s0\": 0.93,\n221\t            \"s7\": 0.91,\n222\t            \"s99\": 0.95,\n223\t            \"mean\": 0.93,\n224\t            \"sd\": 0.02\n225\t          },\n226\t          {\n227\t            \"metric\": \"accuracy\",\n228\t            \"s0\": 0.678,\n229\t            \"s7\": 0.691,\n230\t            \"s99\": 0.669,\n231\t            \"mean\": 0.679,\n232\t            \"sd\": 0.011\n233\t          }\n234\t        ]\n235\t      }\n236\t    ],\n237\t    \"figures\": [],\n238\t    \"analysis\": \"item 抽样引入 ~4pp SD 的不确定性，强化了 bootstrap CI (exp-004) 的方法论必要性。 关键收获：G-coefficient 结论 (binary < 0.40) 跨样本稳健；headline item_id 需要 报告为 ~55% [51, 59] 而非点估计。\\n\\n\\nitem_id 从 50.8% 到 58.6% (SD=3.9pp) 反映了 stratified sampling 未完全消除的 item 难度分布变异。sample7 (50.8%) 恰好抽到了更均匀的 item 难度分布——容易题和 难题的比例更平衡——导致 Bernoulli p(1-p) 变异较小，item_id 机械性降低。这个 ~8pp 极差在 median 档下是 「noisy but directionally consistent」——item_id 始终最大， 但精确百分比对 item draw 敏感。G-coefficient 的 0.30-0.36 范围传递了一致信号： 200 items (binary) 总是不够。CV=7.1% 说明 headline number 必须报告为区间。\\n\"\n239\t  },\n240\t  {\n241\t    \"name\": \"Multi-benchmark replication\",\n242\t    \"description\": \"3 models (Gemma excluded) × 2 prec (bf16/fp16) × 6 prompts × 6 seeds × 2 temps (T=0.0, T=0.7) × 4 orderings × 200 items, on GSM8K, ARC-Challenge, HellaSwag. Reduced design (2 prec × 2 temp vs exp-001 的 3×3)。\\n\",\n243\t    \"results\": {\n244\t      \"conditions_per_model_per_bench\": 576,\n245\t      \"total_records_per_bench\": 345600,\n246\t      \"total_records\": 1036800,\n247\t      \"accuracy_gsm8k\": 0.412,\n248\t      \"accuracy_arc\": 0.588,\n249\t      \"accuracy_hellaswag\": 0.762,\n250\t      \"item_id_pct_gsm8k\": 34.5,\n251\t      \"item_id_pct_arc\": 43.8,\n252\t      \"item_id_pct_hellaswag\": 51.2,\n253\t      \"seed_x_item_gsm8k\": 11.5,\n254\t      \"temp_x_item_gsm8k\": 10.8,\n255\t      \"prompt_x_item_gsm8k\": 9.2,\n256\t      \"seed_x_item_arc\": 5.8,\n257\t      \"temp_x_item_arc\": 7.2,\n258\t      \"prompt_x_item_arc\": 7.5,\n259\t      \"seed_x_item_hellaswag\": 3.4,\n260\t      \"temp_x_item_hellaswag\": 5.5,\n261\t      \"prompt_x_item_hellaswag\": 5.2,\n262\t      \"precision_x_temp_gsm8k_binary\": 0.2,\n263\t      \"precision_x_temp_arc_binary\": 0.15,\n264\t      \"precision_x_temp_hellaswag_binary\": 0.1,\n265\t      \"precision_x_item_gsm8k\": 1.2,\n266\t      \"precision_x_item_arc\": 1.8,\n267\t      \"precision_x_item_hellaswag\": 2.5,\n268\t      \"residual_gsm8k\": 23.8,\n269\t      \"residual_arc\": 18.5,\n270\t      \"residual_hellaswag\": 15.8,\n271\t      \"g_coeff_binary_gsm8k\": 0.22,\n272\t      \"g_coeff_binary_arc\": 0.28,\n273\t      \"g_coeff_binary_hellaswag\": 0.35,\n274\t      \"g_coeff_text_match_gsm8k\": 0.78,\n275\t      \"g_coeff_text_match_arc\": 0.88,\n276\t      \"g_coeff_text_match_hellaswag\": 0.95,\n277\t      \"gpu_hours_used\": 178\n278\t    },\n279\t    \"tables\": [\n280\t      {\n281\t        \"name\": \"Table 4: Cross-benchmark single-model variance decomposition (binary, 3-model avg, %)\",\n282\t        \"rows\": [\n283\t          {\n284\t            \"source\": \"item_id\",\n285\t            \"GSM8K\": 34.5,\n286\t            \"ARC\": 43.8,\n287\t            \"HellaSwag\": 51.2,\n288\t            \"MMLU (exp-001)\": 52.9\n289\t          },\n290\t          {\n291\t            \"source\": \"residual\",\n292\t            \"GSM8K\": 23.8,\n293\t            \"ARC\": 18.5,\n294\t            \"HellaSwag\": 15.8,\n295\t            \"MMLU (exp-001)\": 17.1\n296\t          },\n297\t          {\n298\t            \"source\": \"seed×item\",\n299\t            \"GSM8K\": 11.5,\n300\t            \"ARC\": 5.8,\n301\t            \"HellaSwag\": 3.4,\n302\t            \"MMLU (exp-001)\": 3.1\n303\t          },\n304\t          {\n305\t            \"source\": \"temp×item\",\n306\t            \"GSM8K\": 10.8,\n307\t            \"ARC\": 7.2,\n308\t            \"HellaSwag\": 5.5,\n309\t            \"MMLU (exp-001)\": 6.4\n310\t          },\n311\t          {\n312\t            \"source\": \"prompt×item\",\n313\t            \"GSM8K\": 9.2,\n314\t            \"ARC\": 7.5,\n315\t            \"HellaSwag\": 5.2,\n316\t            \"MMLU (exp-001)\": 5.6\n317\t          },\n318\t          {\n319\t            \"source\": \"prec×item\",\n320\t            \"GSM8K\": 1.2,\n321\t            \"ARC\": 1.8,\n322\t            \"HellaSwag\": 2.5,\n323\t            \"MMLU (exp-001)\": 7.0\n324\t          },\n325\t          {\n326\t            \"source\": \"prec×temp\",\n327\t            \"GSM8K\": 0.2,\n328\t            \"ARC\": 0.15,\n329\t            \"HellaSwag\": 0.1,\n330\t            \"MMLU (exp-001)\": 0.3\n331\t          },\n332\t          {\n333\t            \"source\": \"other\",\n334\t            \"GSM8K\": 8.8,\n335\t            \"ARC\": 15.25,\n336\t            \"HellaSwag\": 16.3,\n337\t            \"MMLU (exp-001)\": 7.6\n338\t          }\n339\t        ]\n340\t      },\n341\t      {\n342\t        \"name\": \"Table 5: Per-benchmark accuracy by model (bf16, all-condition avg)\",\n343\t        \"rows\": [\n344\t          {\n345\t            \"benchmark\": \"GSM8K\",\n346\t            \"Llama\": 0.486,\n347\t            \"Qwen\": 0.452,\n348\t            \"Mistral\": 0.298\n349\t          },\n350\t          {\n351\t            \"benchmark\": \"ARC\",\n352\t            \"Llama\": 0.641,\n353\t            \"Qwen\": 0.618,\n354\t            \"Mistral\": 0.505\n355\t          },\n356\t          {\n357\t            \"benchmark\": \"HellaSwag\",\n358\t            \"Llama\": 0.798,\n359\t            \"Qwen\": 0.782,\n360\t            \"Mistral\": 0.707\n361\t          }\n362\t        ]\n363\t      },\n364\t      {\n365\t        \"name\": \"Table 6: G-coefficients by benchmark × metric (200 items)\",\n366\t        \"rows\": [\n367\t          {\n368\t            \"benchmark\": \"GSM8K\",\n369\t            \"g_binary\": 0.22,\n370\t            \"g_text_match\": 0.78\n371\t          },\n372\t          {\n373\t            \"benchmark\": \"ARC\",\n374\t            \"g_binary\": 0.28,\n375\t            \"g_text_match\": 0.88\n376\t          },\n377\t          {\n378\t            \"benchmark\": \"HellaSwag\",\n379\t            \"g_binary\": 0.35,\n380\t            \"g_text_match\": 0.95\n381\t          },\n382\t          {\n383\t            \"benchmark\": \"MMLU (exp-001)\",\n384\t            \"g_binary\": 0.33,\n385\t            \"g_text_match\": 0.94\n386\t          }\n387\t        ]\n388\t      }\n389\t    ],\n390\t    \"figures\": [],\n391\t    \"analysis\": \"cross-benchmark gradient 的方向性成立但非单调：HellaSwag (51.2%) 与 MMLU (52.9%) 仅差 1.7pp (统计上不可区分)，ARC (43.8%) 居中，GSM8K (34.5%) 明显更低。梯度范围 18.4pp (52.9→34.5)。但这是单模型数据——model-as-facet (exp-004) 会进一步压缩 item_id 并可能 改变排序。exp-002 的 bf16/fp16-only 设计意味着 precision 相关方差分量不可与 exp-001 (3 prec) 直接比较；MD8 sensitivity analysis 需要 re-analyze MMLU with matched 2×2。\\n\\n\\nGSM8K item_id (34.5%, 单模型) 大幅低于 MMLU (52.9%)，因为数学推理中 seed 和 temperature 通过改变 chain-of-thought 路径产生强 item-conditional 效应。同一数学题 在不同 seed 下走不同推理链——有的走通有的走不通——seed×item (11.5%) 和 temp×item (10.8%) 合计 >22%，远超 MMLU 的 ~9.5%。ARC (43.8%) 居中因为科学推理也有 prompt/ seed sensitivity 但弱于数学。HellaSwag (51.2%) 接近 MMLU (52.9%) 是 median 档的 关键特征——commonsense 补全任务的方差结构更接近 knowledge retrieval 而非 multi-step reasoning，因为 HellaSwag 主要考验的是 pattern completion 而非推理链。这打破了预期 的单调 knowledge→reasoning 梯度。precision 交互在 bf16/fp16-only 设计下全部 <0.3% (binary)——这不构成对 separability 的有力测试，因为 bf16≈fp16 是已知的。真正的 separability 测试需要 fp32 或 hardware crossing，只在 exp-001/003 (MMLU) 中完成。 G-coefficient 梯度 (0.22→0.35 binary) 说明 200-item binary 可靠性系统性随任务类型 变化，但 text_match 下 HellaSwag 已达 0.95，强化 metric-conditional 叙事。\\n\"\n392\t  },\n393\t  {\n394\t    \"name\": \"Multi-hardware G-study\",\n395\t    \"description\": \"3 models × 2 GPU types (RTX PRO 6000 + second GPU) × 2 prec (bf16/fp16) × 6 prompts × 6 seeds × 3 temps × 4 orderings × 200 MMLU items。 Second GPU 可用性有限——仅 2 models 在 second GPU 上完成全部设计。\\n\",\n396\t    \"results\": {\n397\t      \"total_records_primary_gpu\": 518400,\n398\t      \"total_records_second_gpu\": 230400,\n399\t      \"total_records\": 748800,\n400\t      \"models_on_both_gpus\": 2,\n401\t      \"second_gpu_availability_days\": 8,\n402\t      \"hardware_main_effect_pp\": 0.14,\n403\t      \"hardware_pct_variance\": 0.08,\n404\t      \"hardware_x_item_pct\": 1.8,\n405\t      \"hardware_x_precision_pct\": 0.12,\n406\t      \"hardware_x_temperature_pct\": 0.06,\n407\t      \"hardware_x_prompt_pct\": 0.03,\n408\t      \"hardware_x_seed_pct\": 0.02,\n409\t      \"direct_infra_x_method_binary\": 0.5,\n410\t      \"direct_infra_x_method_text_match\": 2.8,\n411\t      \"item_id_pct_with_hw\": 53.2,\n412\t      \"precision_pct\": 0.15,\n413\t      \"hardware_pct\": 0.08,\n414\t      \"residual_pct\": 15.8,\n415\t      \"max_item_accuracy_gap_across_gpus_pp\": 3.2,\n416\t      \"items_with_flipped_majority_vote\": 4,\n417\t      \"gpu_hours_used\": 95\n418\t    },\n419\t    \"tables\": [\n420\t      {\n421\t        \"name\": \"Table 7: Hardware effect summary (2-model balanced MMLU)\",\n422\t        \"rows\": [\n423\t          {\n424\t            \"metric\": \"aggregate accuracy gap (pp)\",\n425\t            \"value\": 0.14\n426\t          },\n427\t          {\n428\t            \"metric\": \"max item-level gap (pp)\",\n429\t            \"value\": 3.2\n430\t          },\n431\t          {\n432\t            \"metric\": \"hardware % total variance\",\n433\t            \"value\": 0.08\n434\t          },\n435\t          {\n436\t            \"metric\": \"hardware×item % variance\",\n437\t            \"value\": 1.8\n438\t          },\n439\t          {\n440\t            \"metric\": \"direct infra×method binary (%)\",\n441\t            \"value\": 0.5\n442\t          },\n443\t          {\n444\t            \"metric\": \"direct infra×method text_match (%)\",\n445\t            \"value\": 2.8\n446\t          },\n447\t          {\n448\t            \"metric\": \"items with flipped majority vote\",\n449\t            \"value\": 4\n450\t          }\n451\t        ]\n452\t      }\n453\t    ],\n454\t    \"figures\": [],\n455\t    \"analysis\": \"multi-hardware 支持 aggregate separability but with caveats。binary 0.5% 勉强通过 <1% 阈值；text_match 2.8% 明确超过实际意义阈值。论文应将此定位为 「preliminary evidence supporting separability on MMLU under binary scoring, with metric-conditional violation under text_match」。2-model 限制意味着 bootstrap CI 很宽——hardware facet 的估计是所有方差分量中精度最低的。\\n\\n\\nhardware 主效应极小 (0.14pp) 因为相同 vLLM 代码路径在不同 GPU 上产生几乎相同的结果； 差异来自 CUDA kernel 层面的浮点非确定性和 GPU 架构特定的 tensor core 实现差异。 hardware×item (1.8%) 比 hardware 主效应大一个数量级，因为 logit margin 极小的 items (模型在 0/1 边界附近的题) 对硬件级数值噪声敏感。但 1.8% 仍远小于 precision×item (MMLU exp-001 ~7%)，说明 GPU 型号的影响远弱于精度选择。direct infra×method 在 binary 下 0.5% (边缘通过 <1% 阈值)，text_match 下 2.8%——后者由 precision×temperature (1.5%) + hardware×temperature (0.8%) + hardware×precision (0.5%) 累积而成。median 档的 关键限制是 second GPU 仅支持 2 模型，估计精度有限，结论需标注为 preliminary。\\n\"\n456\t  },\n457\t  {\n458\t    \"name\": \"Comprehensive analysis\",\n459\t    \"description\": \"Combined analysis of exp-001/001b/002/003。核心产出：model-as-facet reanalysis, bootstrap CIs, D-study projections, G-theory vs IRT, all MD defense analyses。 纯分析实验 (0 GPU hours)。\\n\",\n460\t    \"results\": {\n461\t      \"maf_item_id_mmlu\": 35.0,\n462\t      \"maf_model_x_item_mmlu\": 21.5,\n463\t      \"maf_model_mmlu\": 8.2,\n464\t      \"maf_residual_mmlu\": 12.8,\n465\t      \"maf_prec_x_item_mmlu\": 5.2,\n466\t      \"maf_temp_x_item_mmlu\": 4.6,\n467\t      \"maf_prompt_x_item_mmlu\": 4.0,\n468\t      \"maf_seed_x_item_mmlu\": 2.5,\n469\t      \"maf_order_x_item_mmlu\": 1.5,\n470\t      \"maf_model_x_prec_mmlu\": 0.5,\n471\t      \"maf_model_x_temp_mmlu\": 0.3,\n472\t      \"maf_other_mmlu\": 3.9,\n473\t      \"maf_item_id_hellaswag\": 33.0,\n474\t      \"maf_item_id_arc\": 27.0,\n475\t      \"maf_item_id_gsm8k\": 20.0,\n476\t      \"maf_model_x_item_hellaswag\": 16.0,\n477\t      \"maf_model_x_item_arc\": 18.5,\n478\t      \"maf_model_x_item_gsm8k\": 26.0,\n479\t      \"maf_model_gsm8k\": 14.0,\n480\t      \"maf_model_arc\": 12.0,\n481\t      \"maf_model_hellaswag\": 9.5,\n482\t      \"ci_item_id_mmlu\": \"[28.5, 41.5]\",\n483\t      \"ci_model_x_item_mmlu\": \"[15.0, 28.0]\",\n484\t      \"ci_item_id_gsm8k\": \"[13.5, 26.5]\",\n485\t      \"ci_model_x_item_gsm8k\": \"[19.5, 32.5]\",\n486\t      \"ci_width_item_id_mmlu\": 13.0,\n487\t      \"ci_width_item_id_gsm8k\": 13.0,\n488\t      \"ci_overlap_mmlu\": false,\n489\t      \"ci_overlap_hellaswag\": false,\n490\t      \"ci_overlap_arc\": false,\n491\t      \"ci_overlap_gsm8k\": true,\n492\t      \"dstudy_g90_mmlu\": 620,\n493\t      \"dstudy_g90_hellaswag\": 480,\n494\t      \"dstudy_g90_arc\": 540,\n495\t      \"dstudy_g90_gsm8k\": 780,\n496\t      \"dstudy_g95_mmlu\": 1100,\n497\t      \"dstudy_g_at_200_mmlu_binary\": 0.3,\n498\t      \"dstudy_g_at_200_mmlu_text_match\": 0.93,\n499\t      \"dstudy_g_at_14k_mmlu_binary\": 0.985,\n500\t      \"reml_henderson_max_diff_pp\": 2.8,\n501\t      \"reml_henderson_rank_preserved\": true,\n502\t      \"logprob_item_id_mmlu\": 48.0,\n503\t      \"logprob_item_id_gsm8k\": 25.0,\n504\t      \"gtheory_items_mmlu\": 620,\n505\t      \"irt_tinyBench_items\": 100,\n506\t      \"gtheory_irt_ratio\": 6.2,\n507\t      \"power_detect_2pct\": 0.88,\n508\t      \"power_detect_1pct\": 0.62,\n509\t      \"fixed_random_max_diff_pp\": 3.5,\n510\t      \"fixed_random_rank_preserved\": true,\n511\t      \"bernoulli_corr_with_item_id\": 0.72,\n512\t      \"bootstrap_jackknife_ci_ratio\": 1.15,\n513\t      \"mmlu_3x3_vs_2x2_item_id_diff\": 2.1,\n514\t      \"g_at_14k_binary\": 0.985,\n515\t      \"gpu_hours_for_g90_mmlu\": 45,\n516\t      \"gpu_hours_for_g90_gsm8k\": 85\n517\t    },\n518\t    \"tables\": [\n519\t      {\n520\t        \"name\": \"Table 8: Model-as-facet variance decomposition across benchmarks (binary, %)\",\n521\t        \"rows\": [\n522\t          {\n523\t            \"source\": \"item_id\",\n524\t            \"MMLU\": 35.0,\n525\t            \"HellaSwag\": 33.0,\n526\t            \"ARC\": 27.0,\n527\t            \"GSM8K\": 20.0\n528\t          },\n529\t          {\n530\t            \"source\": \"model×item\",\n531\t            \"MMLU\": 21.5,\n532\t            \"HellaSwag\": 16.0,\n533\t            \"ARC\": 18.5,\n534\t            \"GSM8K\": 26.0\n535\t          },\n536\t          {\n537\t            \"source\": \"model\",\n538\t            \"MMLU\": 8.2,\n539\t            \"HellaSwag\": 9.5,\n540\t            \"ARC\": 12.0,\n541\t            \"GSM8K\": 14.0\n542\t          },\n543\t          {\n544\t            \"source\": \"residual\",\n545\t            \"MMLU\": 12.8,\n546\t            \"HellaSwag\": 14.0,\n547\t            \"ARC\": 16.0,\n548\t            \"GSM8K\": 13.5\n549\t          },\n550\t          {\n551\t            \"source\": \"temp×item\",\n552\t            \"MMLU\": 4.6,\n553\t            \"HellaSwag\": 5.2,\n554\t            \"ARC\": 6.0,\n555\t            \"GSM8K\": 7.8\n556\t          },\n557\t          {\n558\t            \"source\": \"prompt×item\",\n559\t            \"MMLU\": 4.0,\n560\t            \"HellaSwag\": 4.5,\n561\t            \"ARC\": 5.8,\n562\t            \"GSM8K\": 6.5\n563\t          },\n564\t          {\n565\t            \"source\": \"prec×item\",\n566\t            \"MMLU\": 5.2,\n567\t            \"HellaSwag\": 3.5,\n568\t            \"ARC\": 1.5,\n569\t            \"GSM8K\": 1.0\n570\t          },\n571\t          {\n572\t            \"source\": \"seed×item\",\n573\t            \"MMLU\": 2.5,\n574\t            \"HellaSwag\": 2.8,\n575\t            \"ARC\": 4.0,\n576\t            \"GSM8K\": 5.5\n577\t          },\n578\t          {\n579\t            \"source\": \"other\",\n580\t            \"MMLU\": 6.2,\n581\t            \"HellaSwag\": 11.5,\n582\t            \"ARC\": 9.2,\n583\t            \"GSM8K\": 5.7\n584\t          }\n585\t        ]\n586\t      },\n587\t      {\n588\t        \"name\": \"Table 9: Bootstrap 95% CIs on item_id and model×item (pp)\",\n589\t        \"rows\": [\n590\t          {\n591\t            \"benchmark\": \"MMLU\",\n592\t            \"item_id\": \"35.0 [28.5–41.5]\",\n593\t            \"model_x_item\": \"21.5 [15.0–28.0]\",\n594\t            \"overlap\": \"No\"\n595\t          },\n596\t          {\n597\t            \"benchmark\": \"HellaSwag\",\n598\t            \"item_id\": \"33.0 [26.0–40.0]\",\n599\t            \"model_x_item\": \"16.0 [10.5–21.5]\",\n600\t            \"overlap\": \"No\"\n601\t          },\n602\t          {\n603\t            \"benchmark\": \"ARC\",\n604\t            \"item_id\": \"27.0 [20.5–33.5]\",\n605\t            \"model_x_item\": \"18.5 [12.0–25.0]\",\n606\t            \"overlap\": \"No\"\n607\t          },\n608\t          {\n609\t            \"benchmark\": \"GSM8K\",\n610\t            \"item_id\": \"20.0 [13.5–26.5]\",\n611\t            \"model_x_item\": \"26.0 [19.5–32.5]\",\n612\t            \"overlap\": \"Yes\"\n613\t          }\n614\t        ]\n615\t      },\n616\t      {\n617\t        \"name\": \"Table 10: D-study — items for target G (binary, 6 prompts × 6 seeds averaged)\",\n618\t        \"rows\": [\n619\t          {\n620\t            \"benchmark\": \"MMLU\",\n621\t            \"G_0.80\": 280,\n622\t            \"G_0.90\": 620,\n623\t            \"G_0.95\": 1100,\n624\t            \"G_0.99\": 4200\n625\t          },\n626\t          {\n627\t            \"benchmark\": \"HellaSwag\",\n628\t            \"G_0.80\": 240,\n629\t            \"G_0.90\": 480,\n630\t            \"G_0.95\": 850,\n631\t            \"G_0.99\": 3200\n632\t          },\n633\t          {\n634\t            \"benchmark\": \"ARC\",\n635\t            \"G_0.80\": 260,\n636\t            \"G_0.90\": 540,\n637\t            \"G_0.95\": 960,\n638\t            \"G_0.99\": 3600\n639\t          },\n640\t          {\n641\t            \"benchmark\": \"GSM8K\",\n642\t            \"G_0.80\": 380,\n643\t            \"G_0.90\": 780,\n644\t            \"G_0.95\": 1400,\n645\t            \"G_0.99\": 5200\n646\t          }\n647\t        ]\n648\t      },\n649\t      {\n650\t        \"name\": \"Table 11: G-theory vs IRT subsampling (MMLU)\",\n651\t        \"rows\": [\n652\t          {\n653\t            \"framework\": \"G-theory D-study\",\n654\t            \"items\": 620,\n655\t            \"facets\": \"item+prompt+seed+temp+order+prec\",\n656\t            \"target\": \"G≥0.90\"\n657\t          },\n658\t          {\n659\t            \"framework\": \"tinyBenchmarks IRT\",\n660\t            \"items\": 100,\n661\t            \"facets\": \"item only\",\n662\t            \"target\": \"r≥0.95 with full\"\n663\t          },\n664\t          {\n665\t            \"framework\": \"ratio\",\n666\t            \"items\": \"6.2×\",\n667\t            \"facets\": \"—\",\n668\t            \"target\": \"different definitions\"\n669\t          }\n670\t        ]\n671\t      },\n672\t      {\n673\t        \"name\": \"Table 12: Methodological defense results summary\",\n674\t        \"rows\": [\n675\t          {\n676\t            \"defense\": \"MD1 Bernoulli\",\n677\t            \"result\": \"r=0.72 with p(1-p); ~50% mechanical\",\n678\t            \"verdict\": \"acknowledged, text_match parallel validates\"\n679\t          },\n680\t          {\n681\t            \"defense\": \"MD2 Fixed vs random\",\n682\t            \"result\": \"max diff 3.5pp, rank preserved\",\n683\t            \"verdict\": \"robust\"\n684\t          },\n685\t          {\n686\t            \"defense\": \"MD5 Full benchmark G\",\n687\t            \"result\": \"G=0.985 at 14K items (binary)\",\n688\t            \"verdict\": \"200-item G correctly interpreted as subsample cost\"\n689\t          },\n690\t          {\n691\t            \"defense\": \"MD6 Bootstrap vs jackknife\",\n692\t            \"result\": \"CI ratio 1.15\",\n693\t            \"verdict\": \"bootstrap slightly wider, acceptable\"\n694\t          },\n695\t          {\n696\t            \"defense\": \"MD8 Design asymmetry\",\n697\t            \"result\": \"3×3 vs 2×2 diff 2.1pp item_id\",\n698\t            \"verdict\": \"robust to design reduction\"\n699\t          },\n700\t          {\n701\t            \"defense\": \"MD9 Logprob scoring\",\n702\t            \"result\": \"item_id 48% (MMLU) / 25% (GSM8K)\",\n703\t            \"verdict\": \"gradient preserved across metrics\"\n704\t          }\n705\t        ]\n706\t      }\n707\t    ],\n708\t    \"figures\": [],\n709\t    \"analysis\": \"exp-004 重新定义了叙事。Claim 1 从「item is THE dominant source」变为「item and model×item jointly dominate — their relative importance is benchmark-conditional」。 GSM8K 上的 CI 重叠和 model×item 反超是 median 档最大的叙事压力点——需要诚实报告但 框定为「finding: even the variance structure itself varies across task types」。 D-study 的 benchmark-specificity (480-780 items) 支持 Claim 3 但 differentiation 不戏剧性——4 benchmarks 都在 ~500-800 range，不是 100 vs 2000 那样的鲜明对比。 G-theory vs IRT 的 6.2× gap 是可以独立展开的贡献——「the cost of multi-facet reliability」。power=0.88 for 2% interaction 意味着如果真实 infra×method 在 2% 以上我们大概率能检测到，但 <1% 的效应 (power=0.62) 可能被遗漏——论文需承认这一限制。\\n\\n\\nmodel-as-facet 将 MMLU item_id 从 52.9% 压到 35%：差额中 ~17.9pp 被重新归因为 model×item (21.5%) 和 model (8.2%)。在单模型分析中，不同模型对不同 items 的差异化 表现 (differential item functioning) 被隐藏在 item_id 和 residual 中；3 模型设计 使其可分离。35% 仍是最大方差源，但与 model×item (21.5%) 的差距仅 13.5pp。在 GSM8K 上 model×item (26%) 反超 item_id (20%)——因为 3 模型在数学题上的能力差异极大 (Qwen 45% vs Mistral 30%)，且不同模型擅长不同类型的数学题，创造了巨大的 model×item 交互。GSM8K 的 CI 重叠 ([13.5, 26.5] vs [19.5, 32.5]) 是 median 档的标志—— 无法在统计上区分 item_id 和 model×item 谁更大。 D-study 620 items (MMLU binary G≥0.90) vs IRT 100 items 的 6.2× 差距反映了本质区别： IRT 只关注 item sampling 对排名一致性的影响，G-theory 同时控制 prompt/seed/ordering 的变异性。620 items 是对「用 1 prompt + 1 seed + 200 items 评估」这种 common practice 的方法论批判——但 480-780 的跨 benchmark 范围说明 differentiation 没有预期的戏剧性。 Bernoulli 相关 r=0.72 说明 item_id 中约一半是 p(1-p) 机械效应，但这不削弱 practical implication——item 选择确实改变评估结果。bootstrap vs jackknife CI 比值 1.15 说明 bootstrap 略微高估不确定性（因为重采样破坏 item 独立性），但差异可接受。\\n\"\n710\t  },\n711\t  {\n712\t    \"name\": \"14B model extension\",\n713\t    \"description\": \"Qwen3-14B, DeepSeek-R1-Distill-14B × bf16/fp16 × 6 prompts × 6 seeds × 2 temps × 4 orderings × 200 MMLU items。验证 scale robustness。\\n\",\n714\t    \"results\": {\n715\t      \"total_records_per_model\": 115200,\n716\t      \"total_records\": 230400,\n717\t      \"accuracy_qwen14b_bf16\": 0.752,\n718\t      \"accuracy_deepseek14b_bf16\": 0.738,\n719\t      \"precision_gap_pp_avg\": 0.35,\n720\t      \"item_id_pct_qwen14b\": 50.5,\n721\t      \"item_id_pct_deepseek14b\": 46.8,\n722\t      \"item_id_pct_avg\": 48.7,\n723\t      \"prompt_x_item_deepseek14b\": 8.2,\n724\t      \"g_coeff_binary_200_avg\": 0.35,\n725\t      \"gpu_hours_used\": 85\n726\t    },\n727\t    \"tables\": [\n728\t      {\n729\t        \"name\": \"Table S1: 8B vs 14B variance structure (MMLU, single-model, binary, %)\",\n730\t        \"rows\": [\n731\t          {\n732\t            \"source\": \"item_id\",\n733\t            \"8B avg\": 52.9,\n734\t            \"Qwen3_14B\": 50.5,\n735\t            \"DeepSeek_14B\": 46.8\n736\t          },\n737\t          {\n738\t            \"source\": \"prec×item\",\n739\t            \"8B avg\": 7.0,\n740\t            \"Qwen3_14B\": 3.2,\n741\t            \"DeepSeek_14B\": 2.8\n742\t          },\n743\t          {\n744\t            \"source\": \"prompt×item\",\n745\t            \"8B avg\": 5.6,\n746\t            \"Qwen3_14B\": 5.0,\n747\t            \"DeepSeek_14B\": 8.2\n748\t          },\n749\t          {\n750\t            \"source\": \"precision\",\n751\t            \"8B avg\": 2.1,\n752\t            \"Qwen3_14B\": 0.2,\n753\t            \"DeepSeek_14B\": 0.15\n754\t          }\n755\t        ]\n756\t      }\n757\t    ],\n758\t    \"figures\": [],\n759\t    \"analysis\": \"Scale robustness 得到确认。14B 的 precision sensitivity 大幅下降 (<0.4pp) 是一个 useful practical finding——更大的模型对数值精度更稳健。适合 Appendix/Supplementary。\\n\\n\\n14B 模型的 item_id (~49%) 略低于 8B (~53%)，因为更强的模型对更多 items 有高置信 正确答案 (ceiling effect)，压缩了 item 间 accuracy 变异。precision gap 从 ~8pp 降到 <0.4pp——14B 模型 logit margin 更大，bf16/fp16 truncation 几乎不翻转预测。 DeepSeek-R1-Distill 的 prompt×item 偏高 (8.2%) 可能源于 reasoning-distilled 架构对 prompt 格式的条件依赖更强。整体方差结构保持一致，支持跨 scale 泛化。\\n\"\n760\t  },\n761\t  {\n762\t    \"name\": \"Fine-tuning G-study\",\n763\t    \"description\": \"RoBERTa-large fine-tuning × SST-2/MNLI/RTE/COPA。6 seeds × 3 LR × 4 data shuffles × 3 GPUs × 2 precisions = 432 runs/task × 4 tasks = 1728 total。\\n\",\n764\t    \"results\": {\n765\t      \"total_runs\": 1728,\n766\t      \"tasks_completed\": 4,\n767\t      \"learning_rate_pct\": 22.0,\n768\t      \"seed_pct\": 18.5,\n769\t      \"data_shuffle_pct\": 16.0,\n770\t      \"item_id_pct\": 12.5,\n771\t      \"residual_pct\": 14.0,\n772\t      \"lr_x_item_pct\": 4.8,\n773\t      \"seed_x_item_pct\": 5.5,\n774\t      \"data_shuffle_x_item_pct\": 3.5,\n775\t      \"gpu_pct\": 0.6,\n776\t      \"precision_pct\": 0.4,\n777\t      \"gpu_x_precision_pct\": 0.2,\n778\t      \"other_pct\": 2.0,\n779\t      \"g_coeff_binary_avg\": 0.45,\n780\t      \"accuracy_sst2\": 0.942,\n781\t      \"accuracy_mnli\": 0.876,\n782\t      \"accuracy_rte\": 0.728,\n783\t      \"accuracy_copa\": 0.685,\n784\t      \"item_id_rank\": 4,\n785\t      \"top_source\": \"learning_rate\",\n786\t      \"gpu_hours_used\": 165\n787\t    },\n788\t    \"tables\": [\n789\t      {\n790\t        \"name\": \"Table S2: Inference vs fine-tuning variance hierarchy (%)\",\n791\t        \"rows\": [\n792\t          {\n793\t            \"source\": \"item_id / item_id\",\n794\t            \"inference_MMLU\": 52.9,\n795\t            \"finetuning_avg\": 12.5,\n796\t            \"shift\": \"↓41pp (#1→#4)\"\n797\t          },\n798\t          {\n799\t            \"source\": \"precision / learning_rate\",\n800\t            \"inference_MMLU\": 2.1,\n801\t            \"finetuning_avg\": 22.0,\n802\t            \"shift\": \"↑20pp (不同 facet)\"\n803\t          },\n804\t          {\n805\t            \"source\": \"seed main / seed main\",\n806\t            \"inference_MMLU\": 0.2,\n807\t            \"finetuning_avg\": 18.5,\n808\t            \"shift\": \"↑18pp\"\n809\t          },\n810\t          {\n811\t            \"source\": \"prompt / data_shuffle\",\n812\t            \"inference_MMLU\": 0.9,\n813\t            \"finetuning_avg\": 16.0,\n814\t            \"shift\": \"↑15pp (不同 facet)\"\n815\t          },\n816\t          {\n817\t            \"source\": \"GPU / GPU\",\n818\t            \"inference_MMLU\": \"<0.1\",\n819\t            \"finetuning_avg\": 0.6,\n820\t            \"shift\": \"≈\"\n821\t          }\n822\t        ]\n823\t      }\n824\t    ],\n825\t    \"figures\": [],\n826\t    \"analysis\": \"fine-tuning 结果为论文贡献了 scope qualification：item dominance 是 inference evaluation 的特征，不是 ML evaluation 的普遍规律。GPU×precision 在 fine-tuning 中也可忽略 (0.2%)，说明 infra separability 跨 paradigm 成立。RTE/COPA 的高 seed variance 与 Dodge et al. (2020) 一致。此实验适合论文 Discussion section 用于 界定 claims 的适用范围。\\n\\n\\nfine-tuning 的方差层级与 inference 根本不同。learning_rate (22%) 主导因为 encoder fine-tuning 在小 LR 范围内对最终性能极敏感 (Dodge et al. 2020)。seed (18.5%) 和 data_shuffle (16%) 上升是因为 SGD 随机性在小数据集 (RTE 2.5K, COPA 400 samples) 上导致训练轨迹显著分歧——不同 seed 可能收敛到 loss landscape 的不同局部最优。 item_id 降到 12.5% 因为 fine-tuning 让模型适应了 task-specific item 难度分布， 压缩了 item 间差异。GPU 和 precision 合计 <1%——training 的随机性远超硬件噪声。 这个「方差层级翻转」(item_id 从 #1 降到 #4) 表明 inference 和 fine-tuning 需要 完全不同的 reproducibility budget。\\n\"\n827\t  },\n828\t  {\n829\t    \"name\": \"LayerCast precision study\",\n830\t    \"description\": \"LayerCast (fp16 storage + fp32 compute) as 4th precision condition on MMLU。 Llama × 4 prec × 3 prompts × 3 seeds × 2 temps × 2 orderings × 200 items。\\n\",\n831\t    \"results\": {\n832\t      \"total_records\": 28800,\n833\t      \"conditions\": 144,\n834\t      \"accuracy_layercast\": 0.708,\n835\t      \"accuracy_bf16\": 0.711,\n836\t      \"accuracy_fp16\": 0.711,\n837\t      \"accuracy_fp32\": 0.604,\n838\t      \"layercast_bf16_gap_pp\": 0.3,\n839\t      \"layercast_fp32_gap_pp\": 10.4,\n840\t      \"precision_variance_with_layercast\": 1.4,\n841\t      \"precision_x_item_with_layercast\": 4.8,\n842\t      \"precision_variance_without_layercast\": 2.1,\n843\t      \"precision_x_item_without_layercast\": 7.0,\n844\t      \"gpu_hours_used\": 18\n845\t    },\n846\t    \"tables\": [\n847\t      {\n848\t        \"name\": \"Table S3: LayerCast vs standard precisions (Llama, MMLU)\",\n849\t        \"rows\": [\n850\t          {\n851\t            \"precision\": \"LayerCast\",\n852\t            \"accuracy\": 0.708,\n853\t            \"prec_pct\": 0.3,\n854\t            \"prec_x_item_pct\": 4.5\n855\t          },\n856\t          {\n857\t            \"precision\": \"bf16\",\n858\t            \"accuracy\": 0.711,\n859\t            \"prec_pct\": 0.1,\n860\t            \"prec_x_item_pct\": 3.8\n861\t          },\n862\t          {\n863\t            \"precision\": \"fp16\",\n864\t            \"accuracy\": 0.711,\n865\t            \"prec_pct\": 0.1,\n866\t            \"prec_x_item_pct\": 3.9\n867\t          },\n868\t          {\n869\t            \"precision\": \"fp32\",\n870\t            \"accuracy\": 0.604,\n871\t            \"prec_pct\": 2.1,\n872\t            \"prec_x_item_pct\": 7.0\n873\t          }\n874\t        ]\n875\t      }\n876\t    ],\n877\t    \"figures\": [],\n878\t    \"analysis\": \"LayerCast 是 Appendix mitigation recommendation。核心贡献是排除 fp32 degradation 的「纯数值精度」解释——fp32 compute 在 LayerCast 中正常工作，问题出在 vLLM fp32 engine path。\\n\\n\\nLayerCast (0.708) 接近 bf16 (0.711) 因为 fp32 compute path 保留了 attention 计算精度，fp16 storage 不影响前向传播。与 pure fp32 (0.604) 的 10.4pp 差距证实 fp32 degradation 不是数值精度本身的问题，而是 vLLM fp32 code path 的系统差异 (可能涉及不同的 attention kernel 或 memory layout)。从 G-theory 角度，加入 LayerCast 后 precision 方差分量从 2.1% 降到 1.4%——有改善但不戏剧性，因为 fp32 仍然是 outlier。precision×item 从 7.0% 降到 4.8% 说明 LayerCast 减少了 item-conditional 精度效应。这提供了 practical mitigation recommendation 但 不改变论文核心叙事。\\n\"\n879\t  },\n880\t  {\n881\t    \"name\": \"MATH benchmark extension\",\n882\t    \"description\": \"MATH (200 items) × 3 models × 2 prec (bf16/fp16) × 6 prompts × 6 seeds × 2 temps × 4 orderings。测试 chain-of-thought 推理的方差结构。\\n\",\n883\t    \"results\": {\n884\t      \"total_records\": 345600,\n885\t      \"accuracy_avg\": 0.285,\n886\t      \"accuracy_llama\": 0.312,\n887\t      \"accuracy_qwen\": 0.335,\n888\t      \"accuracy_mistral\": 0.208,\n889\t      \"item_id_pct\": 28.0,\n890\t      \"residual_pct\": 26.5,\n891\t      \"seed_x_item_pct\": 12.8,\n892\t      \"temp_x_item_pct\": 11.5,\n893\t      \"prompt_x_item_pct\": 8.2,\n894\t      \"precision_x_item_pct\": 1.5,\n895\t      \"seed_pct\": 3.2,\n896\t      \"temperature_pct\": 3.5,\n897\t      \"precision_x_temp_binary\": 0.18,\n898\t      \"other_pct\": 4.62,\n899\t      \"maf_item_id\": 16.0,\n900\t      \"maf_model_x_item\": 28.0,\n901\t      \"maf_model\": 15.0,\n902\t      \"g_coeff_binary_200\": 0.18,\n903\t      \"g_coeff_text_match_200\": 0.62,\n904\t      \"dstudy_g90_binary\": 950,\n905\t      \"gpu_hours_used\": 42\n906\t    },\n907\t    \"tables\": [\n908\t      {\n909\t        \"name\": \"Table S4: MATH vs GSM8K vs MMLU (single-model avg, binary, %)\",\n910\t        \"rows\": [\n911\t          {\n912\t            \"source\": \"item_id\",\n913\t            \"MMLU\": 52.9,\n914\t            \"GSM8K\": 34.5,\n915\t            \"MATH\": 28.0\n916\t          },\n917\t          {\n918\t            \"source\": \"seed×item\",\n919\t            \"MMLU\": 3.1,\n920\t            \"GSM8K\": 11.5,\n921\t            \"MATH\": 12.8\n922\t          },\n923\t          {\n924\t            \"source\": \"temp×item\",\n925\t            \"MMLU\": 6.4,\n926\t            \"GSM8K\": 10.8,\n927\t            \"MATH\": 11.5\n928\t          },\n929\t          {\n930\t            \"source\": \"residual\",\n931\t            \"MMLU\": 17.1,\n932\t            \"GSM8K\": 23.8,\n933\t            \"MATH\": 26.5\n934\t          },\n935\t          {\n936\t            \"source\": \"G_binary_200\",\n937\t            \"MMLU\": 0.33,\n938\t            \"GSM8K\": 0.22,\n939\t            \"MATH\": 0.18\n940\t          }\n941\t        ]\n942\t      },\n943\t      {\n944\t        \"name\": \"Table S5: Extended D-study across 5 benchmarks (items for G≥0.90, binary)\",\n945\t        \"rows\": [\n946\t          {\n947\t            \"benchmark\": \"HellaSwag\",\n948\t            \"items\": 480\n949\t          },\n950\t          {\n951\t            \"benchmark\": \"ARC\",\n952\t            \"items\": 540\n953\t          },\n954\t          {\n955\t            \"benchmark\": \"MMLU\",\n956\t            \"items\": 620\n957\t          },\n958\t          {\n959\t            \"benchmark\": \"GSM8K\",\n960\t            \"items\": 780\n961\t          },\n962\t          {\n963\t            \"benchmark\": \"MATH\",\n964\t            \"items\": 950\n965\t          }\n966\t        ]\n967\t      }\n968\t    ],\n969\t    \"figures\": [],\n970\t    \"analysis\": \"MATH 延续并强化了 GSM8K 的模式。5-benchmark 梯度 (HellaSwag 51% ≈ MMLU 53% > ARC 44% > GSM8K 35% > MATH 28%, 单模型; HellaSwag 33% ≈ MMLU 35% > ARC 27% > GSM8K 20% > MATH 16%, model-as-facet) 在方向上一致但 HellaSwag≈MMLU 仍然非单调。 MATH 的加入使 gradient 叙事更有说服力——从 knowledge retrieval 到 multi-step reasoning 的 item_id 递减跨越 ~20pp (model-as-facet)。D-study 范围扩展到 480-950 items (G≥0.90)，differentiation 比只有 4 benchmarks 时更明显。 此实验适合 Supplementary 或 extended analysis，强化 Claim 1 和 Claim 3。\\n\\nMATH 的 item_id (28% 单模型, 16% model-as-facet) 是所有 benchmarks 中最低的， 因为多步数学推理中的 CoT 路径选择引入了巨大的 seed-conditional 和 temp-conditional item 变异。seed×item (12.8%) + temp×item (11.5%) 合计 24.3%——一道题能否做对 取决于模型恰好走了哪条推理链，这是高度随机的。residual 高达 26.5% 反映了 CoT 的内在不可预测性——大量 item-level 方差无法归因于任何已测量 facet。model-as-facet 下 model×item (28%) > item_id (16%)：3 模型的数学能力差异极大 (Qwen 34% vs Mistral 21%)，且不同模型擅长不同类型的数学题 (代数 vs 几何 vs 组合)，创造了 强 differential item functioning。precision×temperature 仅 0.18% (binary) 因为 bf16/fp16-only 设计——这不构成 separability 的有力测试。G=0.18 是所有 benchmark 中最低的，说明 200-item binary 在 MATH 上几乎无信号。D-study 需要 ~950 items 达到 G≥0.90，是 MMLU 的 1.5×。\\n\"\n971\t  }\n972\t]"}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"18b268ca-478e-4248-84eb-ba86eb305b05","uuid":"cc6a4e4c-eac9-49a1-9d44-9962349c8059","timestamp":"2026-05-21T04:11:40.552Z","tool_use_result":{"type":"text","file":{"filePath":"/home/ubuntu/.agent-ml-research-idea_gen_0519/projects/nlp_variance_gtheory/artifacts/dream_reports/dream_20260521T032813/median/experiment_data.json","content":"[\n  {\n    \"name\": \"Full-scale MMLU precision study\",\n    \"description\": \"4 models attempted, Gemma-2-9B-IT fp16 触发 vLLM 数值保护，仅完成 bf16+fp32。 最终 3 模型 (Qwen3-8B, Llama-3.1-8B, Mistral-7B) 完成全部 3 prec × 6 prompts × 6 seeds × 3 temps × 4 orderings × 200 items = 1296 conditions/model。 V0 enforce_eager 修复了 engine confound。\\n\",\n    \"results\": {\n      \"total_records_3model\": 777600,\n      \"gemma_partial_records\": 172800,\n      \"total_records\": 950400,\n      \"conditions_per_model\": 1296,\n      \"accuracy_llama_bf16\": 0.711,\n      \"accuracy_llama_fp16\": 0.711,\n      \"accuracy_llama_fp32\": 0.604,\n      \"accuracy_qwen_bf16\": 0.698,\n      \"accuracy_qwen_fp16\": 0.695,\n      \"accuracy_qwen_fp32\": 0.621,\n      \"accuracy_mistral_bf16\": 0.637,\n      \"accuracy_mistral_fp16\": 0.635,\n      \"accuracy_mistral_fp32\": 0.584,\n      \"item_id_pct_llama\": 57.8,\n      \"item_id_pct_qwen\": 52.6,\n      \"item_id_pct_mistral\": 48.2,\n      \"item_id_pct_avg\": 52.9,\n      \"residual_pct_avg\": 17.1,\n      \"precision_x_item_pct_avg\": 7.0,\n      \"temperature_x_item_pct_avg\": 6.4,\n      \"prompt_x_item_pct_avg\": 5.6,\n      \"seed_x_item_pct_avg\": 3.1,\n      \"ordering_x_item_pct_avg\": 2.0,\n      \"precision_pct_avg\": 2.1,\n      \"temperature_pct_avg\": 1.5,\n      \"prompt_pct_avg\": 0.9,\n      \"precision_x_temperature_binary_avg\": 0.3,\n      \"g_coeff_binary_200item_avg\": 0.33,\n      \"g_coeff_text_match_200item_avg\": 0.94,\n      \"g_coeff_binary_range\": \"[0.30, 0.36]\",\n      \"fp32_bf16_gap_pp_avg\": 8.2,\n      \"null_predictions_total\": 125,\n      \"gpu_hours_used\": 88\n    },\n    \"tables\": [\n      {\n        \"name\": \"Table 1: Per-model accuracy (precision × temperature, 6-prompt 6-seed 4-ordering avg)\",\n        \"rows\": [\n          {\n            \"model\": \"Llama\",\n            \"bf16_T0.0\": 0.73,\n            \"bf16_T0.3\": 0.709,\n            \"bf16_T0.7\": 0.694,\n            \"fp16_T0.0\": 0.731,\n            \"fp16_T0.3\": 0.708,\n            \"fp16_T0.7\": 0.695,\n            \"fp32_T0.0\": 0.622,\n            \"fp32_T0.3\": 0.602,\n            \"fp32_T0.7\": 0.588\n          },\n          {\n            \"model\": \"Qwen\",\n            \"bf16_T0.0\": 0.718,\n            \"bf16_T0.3\": 0.696,\n            \"bf16_T0.7\": 0.681,\n            \"fp16_T0.0\": 0.716,\n            \"fp16_T0.3\": 0.693,\n            \"fp16_T0.7\": 0.677,\n            \"fp32_T0.0\": 0.641,\n            \"fp32_T0.3\": 0.619,\n            \"fp32_T0.7\": 0.604\n          },\n          {\n            \"model\": \"Mistral\",\n            \"bf16_T0.0\": 0.658,\n            \"bf16_T0.3\": 0.636,\n            \"bf16_T0.7\": 0.618,\n            \"fp16_T0.0\": 0.656,\n            \"fp16_T0.3\": 0.633,\n            \"fp16_T0.7\": 0.615,\n            \"fp32_T0.0\": 0.603,\n            \"fp32_T0.3\": 0.582,\n            \"fp32_T0.7\": 0.567\n          }\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"name\": \"Table 2: Single-model G-study variance decomposition (binary, %)\",\n        \"rows\": [\n          {\n            \"source\": \"item_id\",\n            \"Llama\": 57.8,\n            \"Qwen\": 52.6,\n            \"Mistral\": 48.2,\n            \"avg\": 52.9\n          },\n          {\n            \"source\": \"residual\",\n            \"Llama\": 15.2,\n            \"Qwen\": 17.4,\n            \"Mistral\": 18.6,\n            \"avg\": 17.1\n          },\n          {\n            \"source\": \"prec×item\",\n            \"Llama\": 7.5,\n            \"Qwen\": 7.2,\n            \"Mistral\": 6.4,\n            \"avg\": 7.0\n          },\n          {\n            \"source\": \"temp×item\",\n            \"Llama\": 5.8,\n            \"Qwen\": 6.5,\n            \"Mistral\": 6.8,\n            \"avg\": 6.4\n          },\n          {\n            \"source\": \"prompt×item\",\n            \"Llama\": 4.8,\n            \"Qwen\": 5.8,\n            \"Mistral\": 6.2,\n            \"avg\": 5.6\n          },\n          {\n            \"source\": \"seed×item\",\n            \"Llama\": 2.8,\n            \"Qwen\": 3.1,\n            \"Mistral\": 3.4,\n            \"avg\": 3.1\n          },\n          {\n            \"source\": \"order×item\",\n            \"Llama\": 1.8,\n            \"Qwen\": 2.0,\n            \"Mistral\": 2.3,\n            \"avg\": 2.0\n          },\n          {\n            \"source\": \"precision\",\n            \"Llama\": 1.6,\n            \"Qwen\": 2.0,\n            \"Mistral\": 2.8,\n            \"avg\": 2.1\n          },\n          {\n            \"source\": \"temperature\",\n            \"Llama\": 1.2,\n            \"Qwen\": 1.4,\n            \"Mistral\": 1.8,\n            \"avg\": 1.5\n          },\n          {\n            \"source\": \"prec×temp\",\n            \"Llama\": 0.2,\n            \"Qwen\": 0.3,\n            \"Mistral\": 0.5,\n            \"avg\": 0.3\n          },\n          {\n            \"source\": \"other\",\n            \"Llama\": 1.3,\n            \"Qwen\": 1.7,\n            \"Mistral\": 3.0,\n            \"avg\": 2.0\n          }\n        ]\n      }\n    ],\n    \"figures\": [],\n    \"analysis\": \"exp-001 确认了 item dominance 的基本事实但暴露了模型依赖性。Mistral 的 item_id 低 (48%) 源于其 MMLU 表现较弱导致的 Bernoulli 效应，这将在 exp-004 的 MD1 分析中被量化。 fp32 degradation 在 V0 enforce_eager 下持续 (~8pp)，证实是真实精度效应。G=0.33 为 D-study narrative 提供了锚点。3 模型设计允许 model-as-facet 但自由度有限。\\n\\n\\nitem_id 均值 52.9% 比 MVP (58.4%) 略低，因为 MVP 是单模型 (Llama) 的 108 条件设计， 扩展到 3 模型和 1296 条件后估计更稳定。模型间 item_id 从 48.2% (Mistral) 到 57.8% (Llama) 变异 ~10pp：Mistral 整体准确率低 (0.635)，更多 items 接近猜测基线 (p≈0.25)， Bernoulli p(1-p) 变异小于高准确率模型，机械性压缩了 item_id。但在单模型分析中无法分离 model×item——这部分方差归入 item_id 和 residual，预示 exp-004 model-as-facet 会大幅 重塑方差结构。precision×temperature 交互 0.3% (binary) 与 MVP 一致：fp32 degradation 是精度主效应而非与 temperature 的交互效应。G=0.33 (binary) 验证了 200 items 不足以 支撑可靠 model ranking 的核心叙事。text_match G=0.94 的巨大反差锚定了 Claim 3。 Gemma fp16 失败是已知架构限制——median 档下没有修复路径，排除后 3 模型设计仍平衡。\\n\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"name\": \"Item resampling stability test\",\n    \"description\": \"3 independent stratified 200-item MMLU samples (seeds 0, 7, 99) × Llama × 3 prec × 3 prompts × 3 seeds × 2 orderings = 54 conditions/sample × 200 items。\\n\",\n    \"results\": {\n      \"total_records_per_sample\": 10800,\n      \"total_records\": 32400,\n      \"item_id_pct_sample0\": 55.2,\n      \"item_id_pct_sample7\": 50.8,\n      \"item_id_pct_sample99\": 58.6,\n      \"item_id_mean\": 54.9,\n      \"item_id_sd\": 3.9,\n      \"item_id_cv\": 0.071,\n      \"g_coeff_binary_sample0\": 0.34,\n      \"g_coeff_binary_sample7\": 0.3,\n      \"g_coeff_binary_sample99\": 0.36,\n      \"g_coeff_mean\": 0.333,\n      \"g_coeff_sd\": 0.03,\n      \"accuracy_range\": \"[0.669, 0.691]\",\n      \"residual_pct_range\": \"[14.2, 18.6]\",\n      \"item_id_always_largest\": true,\n      \"gpu_hours_used\": 12\n    },\n    \"tables\": [\n      {\n        \"name\": \"Table 3: Resampling stability across 3 item draws\",\n        \"rows\": [\n          {\n            \"metric\": \"item_id_pct\",\n            \"s0\": 55.2,\n            \"s7\": 50.8,\n            \"s99\": 58.6,\n            \"mean\": 54.9,\n            \"sd\": 3.9\n          },\n          {\n            \"metric\": \"residual_pct\",\n            \"s0\": 15.8,\n            \"s7\": 18.6,\n            \"s99\": 14.2,\n            \"mean\": 16.2,\n            \"sd\": 2.3\n          },\n          {\n            \"metric\": \"g_binary\",\n            \"s0\": 0.34,\n            \"s7\": 0.3,\n            \"s99\": 0.36,\n            \"mean\": 0.333,\n            \"sd\": 0.03\n          },\n          {\n            \"metric\": \"g_text_match\",\n            \"s0\": 0.93,\n            \"s7\": 0.91,\n            \"s99\": 0.95,\n            \"mean\": 0.93,\n            \"sd\": 0.02\n          },\n          {\n            \"metric\": \"accuracy\",\n            \"s0\": 0.678,\n            \"s7\": 0.691,\n            \"s99\": 0.669,\n            \"mean\": 0.679,\n            \"sd\": 0.011\n          }\n        ]\n      }\n    ],\n    \"figures\": [],\n    \"analysis\": \"item 抽样引入 ~4pp SD 的不确定性，强化了 bootstrap CI (exp-004) 的方法论必要性。 关键收获：G-coefficient 结论 (binary < 0.40) 跨样本稳健；headline item_id 需要 报告为 ~55% [51, 59] 而非点估计。\\n\\n\\nitem_id 从 50.8% 到 58.6% (SD=3.9pp) 反映了 stratified sampling 未完全消除的 item 难度分布变异。sample7 (50.8%) 恰好抽到了更均匀的 item 难度分布——容易题和 难题的比例更平衡——导致 Bernoulli p(1-p) 变异较小，item_id 机械性降低。这个 ~8pp 极差在 median 档下是 「noisy but directionally consistent」——item_id 始终最大， 但精确百分比对 item draw 敏感。G-coefficient 的 0.30-0.36 范围传递了一致信号： 200 items (binary) 总是不够。CV=7.1% 说明 headline number 必须报告为区间。\\n\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"name\": \"Multi-benchmark replication\",\n    \"description\": \"3 models (Gemma excluded) × 2 prec (bf16/fp16) × 6 prompts × 6 seeds × 2 temps (T=0.0, T=0.7) × 4 orderings × 200 items, on GSM8K, ARC-Challenge, HellaSwag. Reduced design (2 prec × 2 temp vs exp-001 的 3×3)。\\n\",\n    \"results\": {\n      \"conditions_per_model_per_bench\": 576,\n      \"total_records_per_bench\": 345600,\n      \"total_records\": 1036800,\n      \"accuracy_gsm8k\": 0.412,\n      \"accuracy_arc\": 0.588,\n      \"accuracy_hellaswag\": 0.762,\n      \"item_id_pct_gsm8k\": 34.5,\n      \"item_id_pct_arc\": 43.8,\n      \"item_id_pct_hellaswag\": 51.2,\n      \"seed_x_item_gsm8k\": 11.5,\n      \"temp_x_item_gsm8k\": 10.8,\n      \"prompt_x_item_gsm8k\": 9.2,\n      \"seed_x_item_arc\": 5.8,\n      \"temp_x_item_arc\": 7.2,\n      \"prompt_x_item_arc\": 7.5,\n      \"seed_x_item_hellaswag\": 3.4,\n      \"temp_x_item_hellaswag\": 5.5,\n      \"prompt_x_item_hellaswag\": 5.2,\n      \"precision_x_temp_gsm8k_binary\": 0.2,\n      \"precision_x_temp_arc_binary\": 0.15,\n      \"precision_x_temp_hellaswag_binary\": 0.1,\n      \"precision_x_item_gsm8k\": 1.2,\n      \"precision_x_item_arc\": 1.8,\n      \"precision_x_item_hellaswag\": 2.5,\n      \"residual_gsm8k\": 23.8,\n      \"residual_arc\": 18.5,\n      \"residual_hellaswag\": 15.8,\n      \"g_coeff_binary_gsm8k\": 0.22,\n      \"g_coeff_binary_arc\": 0.28,\n      \"g_coeff_binary_hellaswag\": 0.35,\n      \"g_coeff_text_match_gsm8k\": 0.78,\n      \"g_coeff_text_match_arc\": 0.88,\n      \"g_coeff_text_match_hellaswag\": 0.95,\n      \"gpu_hours_used\": 178\n    },\n    \"tables\": [\n      {\n        \"name\": \"Table 4: Cross-benchmark single-model variance decomposition (binary, 3-model avg, %)\",\n        \"rows\": [\n          {\n            \"source\": \"item_id\",\n            \"GSM8K\": 34.5,\n            \"ARC\": 43.8,\n            \"HellaSwag\": 51.2,\n            \"MMLU (exp-001)\": 52.9\n          },\n          {\n            \"source\": \"residual\",\n            \"GSM8K\": 23.8,\n            \"ARC\": 18.5,\n            \"HellaSwag\": 15.8,\n            \"MMLU (exp-001)\": 17.1\n          },\n          {\n            \"source\": \"seed×item\",\n            \"GSM8K\": 11.5,\n            \"ARC\": 5.8,\n            \"HellaSwag\": 3.4,\n            \"MMLU (exp-001)\": 3.1\n          },\n          {\n            \"source\": \"temp×item\",\n            \"GSM8K\": 10.8,\n            \"ARC\": 7.2,\n            \"HellaSwag\": 5.5,\n            \"MMLU (exp-001)\": 6.4\n          },\n          {\n            \"source\": \"prompt×item\",\n            \"GSM8K\": 9.2,\n            \"ARC\": 7.5,\n            \"HellaSwag\": 5.2,\n            \"MMLU (exp-001)\": 5.6\n          },\n          {\n            \"source\": \"prec×item\",\n            \"GSM8K\": 1.2,\n            \"ARC\": 1.8,\n            \"HellaSwag\": 2.5,\n            \"MMLU (exp-001)\": 7.0\n          },\n          {\n            \"source\": \"prec×temp\",\n            \"GSM8K\": 0.2,\n            \"ARC\": 0.15,\n            \"HellaSwag\": 0.1,\n            \"MMLU (exp-001)\": 0.3\n          },\n          {\n            \"source\": \"other\",\n            \"GSM8K\": 8.8,\n            \"ARC\": 15.25,\n            \"HellaSwag\": 16.3,\n            \"MMLU (exp-001)\": 7.6\n          }\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"name\": \"Table 5: Per-benchmark accuracy by model (bf16, all-condition avg)\",\n        \"rows\": [\n          {\n            \"benchmark\": \"GSM8K\",\n            \"Llama\": 0.486,\n            \"Qwen\": 0.452,\n            \"Mistral\": 0.298\n          },\n          {\n            \"benchmark\": \"ARC\",\n            \"Llama\": 0.641,\n            \"Qwen\": 0.618,\n            \"Mistral\": 0.505\n          },\n          {\n            \"benchmark\": \"HellaSwag\",\n            \"Llama\": 0.798,\n            \"Qwen\": 0.782,\n            \"Mistral\": 0.707\n          }\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"name\": \"Table 6: G-coefficients by benchmark × metric (200 items)\",\n        \"rows\": [\n          {\n            \"benchmark\": \"GSM8K\",\n            \"g_binary\": 0.22,\n            \"g_text_match\": 0.78\n          },\n          {\n            \"benchmark\": \"ARC\",\n            \"g_binary\": 0.28,\n            \"g_text_match\": 0.88\n          },\n          {\n            \"benchmark\": \"HellaSwag\",\n            \"g_binary\": 0.35,\n            \"g_text_match\": 0.95\n          },\n          {\n            \"benchmark\": \"MMLU (exp-001)\",\n            \"g_binary\": 0.33,\n            \"g_text_match\": 0.94\n          }\n        ]\n      }\n    ],\n    \"figures\": [],\n    \"analysis\": \"cross-benchmark gradient 的方向性成立但非单调：HellaSwag (51.2%) 与 MMLU (52.9%) 仅差 1.7pp (统计上不可区分)，ARC (43.8%) 居中，GSM8K (34.5%) 明显更低。梯度范围 18.4pp (52.9→34.5)。但这是单模型数据——model-as-facet (exp-004) 会进一步压缩 item_id 并可能 改变排序。exp-002 的 bf16/fp16-only 设计意味着 precision 相关方差分量不可与 exp-001 (3 prec) 直接比较；MD8 sensitivity analysis 需要 re-analyze MMLU with matched 2×2。\\n\\n\\nGSM8K item_id (34.5%, 单模型) 大幅低于 MMLU (52.9%)，因为数学推理中 seed 和 temperature 通过改变 chain-of-thought 路径产生强 item-conditional 效应。同一数学题 在不同 seed 下走不同推理链——有的走通有的走不通——seed×item (11.5%) 和 temp×item (10.8%) 合计 >22%，远超 MMLU 的 ~9.5%。ARC (43.8%) 居中因为科学推理也有 prompt/ seed sensitivity 但弱于数学。HellaSwag (51.2%) 接近 MMLU (52.9%) 是 median 档的 关键特征——commonsense 补全任务的方差结构更接近 knowledge retrieval 而非 multi-step reasoning，因为 HellaSwag 主要考验的是 pattern completion 而非推理链。这打破了预期 的单调 knowledge→reasoning 梯度。precision 交互在 bf16/fp16-only 设计下全部 <0.3% (binary)——这不构成对 separability 的有力测试，因为 bf16≈fp16 是已知的。真正的 separability 测试需要 fp32 或 hardware crossing，只在 exp-001/003 (MMLU) 中完成。 G-coefficient 梯度 (0.22→0.35 binary) 说明 200-item binary 可靠性系统性随任务类型 变化，但 text_match 下 HellaSwag 已达 0.95，强化 metric-conditional 叙事。\\n\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"name\": \"Multi-hardware G-study\",\n    \"description\": \"3 models × 2 GPU types (RTX PRO 6000 + second GPU) × 2 prec (bf16/fp16) × 6 prompts × 6 seeds × 3 temps × 4 orderings × 200 MMLU items。 Second GPU 可用性有限——仅 2 models 在 second GPU 上完成全部设计。\\n\",\n    \"results\": {\n      \"total_records_primary_gpu\": 518400,\n      \"total_records_second_gpu\": 230400,\n      \"total_records\": 748800,\n      \"models_on_both_gpus\": 2,\n      \"second_gpu_availability_days\": 8,\n      \"hardware_main_effect_pp\": 0.14,\n      \"hardware_pct_variance\": 0.08,\n      \"hardware_x_item_pct\": 1.8,\n      \"hardware_x_precision_pct\": 0.12,\n      \"hardware_x_temperature_pct\": 0.06,\n      \"hardware_x_prompt_pct\": 0.03,\n      \"hardware_x_seed_pct\": 0.02,\n      \"direct_infra_x_method_binary\": 0.5,\n      \"direct_infra_x_method_text_match\": 2.8,\n      \"item_id_pct_with_hw\": 53.2,\n      \"precision_pct\": 0.15,\n      \"hardware_pct\": 0.08,\n      \"residual_pct\": 15.8,\n      \"max_item_accuracy_gap_across_gpus_pp\": 3.2,\n      \"items_with_flipped_majority_vote\": 4,\n      \"gpu_hours_used\": 95\n    },\n    \"tables\": [\n      {\n        \"name\": \"Table 7: Hardware effect summary (2-model balanced MMLU)\",\n        \"rows\": [\n          {\n            \"metric\": \"aggregate accuracy gap (pp)\",\n            \"value\": 0.14\n          },\n          {\n            \"metric\": \"max item-level gap (pp)\",\n            \"value\": 3.2\n          },\n          {\n            \"metric\": \"hardware % total variance\",\n            \"value\": 0.08\n          },\n          {\n            \"metric\": \"hardware×item % variance\",\n            \"value\": 1.8\n          },\n          {\n            \"metric\": \"direct infra×method binary (%)\",\n            \"value\": 0.5\n          },\n          {\n            \"metric\": \"direct infra×method text_match (%)\",\n            \"value\": 2.8\n          },\n          {\n            \"metric\": \"items with flipped majority vote\",\n            \"value\": 4\n          }\n        ]\n      }\n    ],\n    \"figures\": [],\n    \"analysis\": \"multi-hardware 支持 aggregate separability but with caveats。binary 0.5% 勉强通过 <1% 阈值；text_match 2.8% 明确超过实际意义阈值。论文应将此定位为 「preliminary evidence supporting separability on MMLU under binary scoring, with metric-conditional violation under text_match」。2-model 限制意味着 bootstrap CI 很宽——hardware facet 的估计是所有方差分量中精度最低的。\\n\\n\\nhardware 主效应极小 (0.14pp) 因为相同 vLLM 代码路径在不同 GPU 上产生几乎相同的结果； 差异来自 CUDA kernel 层面的浮点非确定性和 GPU 架构特定的 tensor core 实现差异。 hardware×item (1.8%) 比 hardware 主效应大一个数量级，因为 logit margin 极小的 items (模型在 0/1 边界附近的题) 对硬件级数值噪声敏感。但 1.8% 仍远小于 precision×item (MMLU exp-001 ~7%)，说明 GPU 型号的影响远弱于精度选择。direct infra×method 在 binary 下 0.5% (边缘通过 <1% 阈值)，text_match 下 2.8%——后者由 precision×temperature (1.5%) + hardware×temperature (0.8%) + hardware×precision (0.5%) 累积而成。median 档的 关键限制是 second GPU 仅支持 2 模型，估计精度有限，结论需标注为 preliminary。\\n\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"name\": \"Comprehensive analysis\",\n    \"description\": \"Combined analysis of exp-001/001b/002/003。核心产出：model-as-facet reanalysis, bootstrap CIs, D-study projections, G-theory vs IRT, all MD defense analyses。 纯分析实验 (0 GPU hours)。\\n\",\n    \"results\": {\n      \"maf_item_id_mmlu\": 35.0,\n      \"maf_model_x_item_mmlu\": 21.5,\n      \"maf_model_mmlu\": 8.2,\n      \"maf_residual_mmlu\": 12.8,\n      \"maf_prec_x_item_mmlu\": 5.2,\n      \"maf_temp_x_item_mmlu\": 4.6,\n      \"maf_prompt_x_item_mmlu\": 4.0,\n      \"maf_seed_x_item_mmlu\": 2.5,\n      \"maf_order_x_item_mmlu\": 1.5,\n      \"maf_model_x_prec_mmlu\": 0.5,\n      \"maf_model_x_temp_mmlu\": 0.3,\n      \"maf_other_mmlu\": 3.9,\n      \"maf_item_id_hellaswag\": 33.0,\n      \"maf_item_id_arc\": 27.0,\n      \"maf_item_id_gsm8k\": 20.0,\n      \"maf_model_x_item_hellaswag\": 16.0,\n      \"maf_model_x_item_arc\": 18.5,\n      \"maf_model_x_item_gsm8k\": 26.0,\n      \"maf_model_gsm8k\": 14.0,\n      \"maf_model_arc\": 12.0,\n      \"maf_model_hellaswag\": 9.5,\n      \"ci_item_id_mmlu\": \"[28.5, 41.5]\",\n      \"ci_model_x_item_mmlu\": \"[15.0, 28.0]\",\n      \"ci_item_id_gsm8k\": \"[13.5, 26.5]\",\n      \"ci_model_x_item_gsm8k\": \"[19.5, 32.5]\",\n      \"ci_width_item_id_mmlu\": 13.0,\n      \"ci_width_item_id_gsm8k\": 13.0,\n      \"ci_overlap_mmlu\": false,\n      \"ci_overlap_hellaswag\": false,\n      \"ci_overlap_arc\": false,\n      \"ci_overlap_gsm8k\": true,\n      \"dstudy_g90_mmlu\": 620,\n      \"dstudy_g90_hellaswag\": 480,\n      \"dstudy_g90_arc\": 540,\n      \"dstudy_g90_gsm8k\": 780,\n      \"dstudy_g95_mmlu\": 1100,\n      \"dstudy_g_at_200_mmlu_binary\": 0.3,\n      \"dstudy_g_at_200_mmlu_text_match\": 0.93,\n      \"dstudy_g_at_14k_mmlu_binary\": 0.985,\n      \"reml_henderson_max_diff_pp\": 2.8,\n      \"reml_henderson_rank_preserved\": true,\n      \"logprob_item_id_mmlu\": 48.0,\n      \"logprob_item_id_gsm8k\": 25.0,\n      \"gtheory_items_mmlu\": 620,\n      \"irt_tinyBench_items\": 100,\n      \"gtheory_irt_ratio\": 6.2,\n      \"power_detect_2pct\": 0.88,\n      \"power_detect_1pct\": 0.62,\n      \"fixed_random_max_diff_pp\": 3.5,\n      \"fixed_random_rank_preserved\": true,\n      \"bernoulli_corr_with_item_id\": 0.72,\n      \"bootstrap_jackknife_ci_ratio\": 1.15,\n      \"mmlu_3x3_vs_2x2_item_id_diff\": 2.1,\n      \"g_at_14k_binary\": 0.985,\n      \"gpu_hours_for_g90_mmlu\": 45,\n      \"gpu_hours_for_g90_gsm8k\": 85\n    },\n    \"tables\": [\n      {\n        \"name\": \"Table 8: Model-as-facet variance decomposition across benchmarks (binary, %)\",\n        \"rows\": [\n          {\n            \"source\": \"item_id\",\n            \"MMLU\": 35.0,\n            \"HellaSwag\": 33.0,\n            \"ARC\": 27.0,\n            \"GSM8K\": 20.0\n          },\n          {\n            \"source\": \"model×item\",\n            \"MMLU\": 21.5,\n            \"HellaSwag\": 16.0,\n            \"ARC\": 18.5,\n            \"GSM8K\": 26.0\n          },\n          {\n            \"source\": \"model\",\n            \"MMLU\": 8.2,\n            \"HellaSwag\": 9.5,\n            \"ARC\": 12.0,\n            \"GSM8K\": 14.0\n          },\n          {\n            \"source\": \"residual\",\n            \"MMLU\": 12.8,\n            \"HellaSwag\": 14.0,\n            \"ARC\": 16.0,\n            \"GSM8K\": 13.5\n          },\n          {\n            \"source\": \"temp×item\",\n            \"MMLU\": 4.6,\n            \"HellaSwag\": 5.2,\n            \"ARC\": 6.0,\n            \"GSM8K\": 7.8\n          },\n          {\n            \"source\": \"prompt×item\",\n            \"MMLU\": 4.0,\n            \"HellaSwag\": 4.5,\n            \"ARC\": 5.8,\n            \"GSM8K\": 6.5\n          },\n          {\n            \"source\": \"prec×item\",\n            \"MMLU\": 5.2,\n            \"HellaSwag\": 3.5,\n            \"ARC\": 1.5,\n            \"GSM8K\": 1.0\n          },\n          {\n            \"source\": \"seed×item\",\n            \"MMLU\": 2.5,\n            \"HellaSwag\": 2.8,\n            \"ARC\": 4.0,\n            \"GSM8K\": 5.5\n          },\n          {\n            \"source\": \"other\",\n            \"MMLU\": 6.2,\n            \"HellaSwag\": 11.5,\n            \"ARC\": 9.2,\n            \"GSM8K\": 5.7\n          }\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"name\": \"Table 9: Bootstrap 95% CIs on item_id and model×item (pp)\",\n        \"rows\": [\n          {\n            \"benchmark\": \"MMLU\",\n            \"item_id\": \"35.0 [28.5–41.5]\",\n            \"model_x_item\": \"21.5 [15.0–28.0]\",\n            \"overlap\": \"No\"\n          },\n          {\n            \"benchmark\": \"HellaSwag\",\n            \"item_id\": \"33.0 [26.0–40.0]\",\n            \"model_x_item\": \"16.0 [10.5–21.5]\",\n            \"overlap\": \"No\"\n          },\n          {\n            \"benchmark\": \"ARC\",\n            \"item_id\": \"27.0 [20.5–33.5]\",\n            \"model_x_item\": \"18.5 [12.0–25.0]\",\n            \"overlap\": \"No\"\n          },\n          {\n            \"benchmark\": \"GSM8K\",\n            \"item_id\": \"20.0 [13.5–26.5]\",\n            \"model_x_item\": \"26.0 [19.5–32.5]\",\n            \"overlap\": \"Yes\"\n          }\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"name\": \"Table 10: D-study — items for target G (binary, 6 prompts × 6 seeds averaged)\",\n        \"rows\": [\n          {\n            \"benchmark\": \"MMLU\",\n            \"G_0.80\": 280,\n            \"G_0.90\": 620,\n            \"G_0.95\": 1100,\n            \"G_0.99\": 4200\n          },\n          {\n            \"benchmark\": \"HellaSwag\",\n            \"G_0.80\": 240,\n            \"G_0.90\": 480,\n            \"G_0.95\": 850,\n            \"G_0.99\": 3200\n          },\n          {\n            \"benchmark\": \"ARC\",\n            \"G_0.80\": 260,\n            \"G_0.90\": 540,\n            \"G_0.95\": 960,\n            \"G_0.99\": 3600\n          },\n          {\n            \"benchmark\": \"GSM8K\",\n            \"G_0.80\": 380,\n            \"G_0.90\": 780,\n            \"G_0.95\": 1400,\n            \"G_0.99\": 5200\n          }\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"name\": \"Table 11: G-theory vs IRT subsampling (MMLU)\",\n        \"rows\": [\n          {\n            \"framework\": \"G-theory D-study\",\n            \"items\": 620,\n            \"facets\": \"item+prompt+seed+temp+order+prec\",\n            \"target\": \"G≥0.90\"\n          },\n          {\n            \"framework\": \"tinyBenchmarks IRT\",\n            \"items\": 100,\n            \"facets\": \"item only\",\n            \"target\": \"r≥0.95 with full\"\n          },\n          {\n            \"framework\": \"ratio\",\n            \"items\": \"6.2×\",\n            \"facets\": \"—\",\n            \"target\": \"different definitions\"\n          }\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"name\": \"Table 12: Methodological defense results summary\",\n        \"rows\": [\n          {\n            \"defense\": \"MD1 Bernoulli\",\n            \"result\": \"r=0.72 with p(1-p); ~50% mechanical\",\n            \"verdict\": \"acknowledged, text_match parallel validates\"\n          },\n          {\n            \"defense\": \"MD2 Fixed vs random\",\n            \"result\": \"max diff 3.5pp, rank preserved\",\n            \"verdict\": \"robust\"\n          },\n          {\n            \"defense\": \"MD5 Full benchmark G\",\n            \"result\": \"G=0.985 at 14K items (binary)\",\n            \"verdict\": \"200-item G correctly interpreted as subsample cost\"\n          },\n          {\n            \"defense\": \"MD6 Bootstrap vs jackknife\",\n            \"result\": \"CI ratio 1.15\",\n            \"verdict\": \"bootstrap slightly wider, acceptable\"\n          },\n          {\n            \"defense\": \"MD8 Design asymmetry\",\n            \"result\": \"3×3 vs 2×2 diff 2.1pp item_id\",\n            \"verdict\": \"robust to design reduction\"\n          },\n          {\n            \"defense\": \"MD9 Logprob scoring\",\n            \"result\": \"item_id 48% (MMLU) / 25% (GSM8K)\",\n            \"verdict\": \"gradient preserved across metrics\"\n          }\n        ]\n      }\n    ],\n    \"figures\": [],\n    \"analysis\": \"exp-004 重新定义了叙事。Claim 1 从「item is THE dominant source」变为「item and model×item jointly dominate — their relative importance is benchmark-conditional」。 GSM8K 上的 CI 重叠和 model×item 反超是 median 档最大的叙事压力点——需要诚实报告但 框定为「finding: even the variance structure itself varies across task types」。 D-study 的 benchmark-specificity (480-780 items) 支持 Claim 3 但 differentiation 不戏剧性——4 benchmarks 都在 ~500-800 range，不是 100 vs 2000 那样的鲜明对比。 G-theory vs IRT 的 6.2× gap 是可以独立展开的贡献——「the cost of multi-facet reliability」。power=0.88 for 2% interaction 意味着如果真实 infra×method 在 2% 以上我们大概率能检测到，但 <1% 的效应 (power=0.62) 可能被遗漏——论文需承认这一限制。\\n\\n\\nmodel-as-facet 将 MMLU item_id 从 52.9% 压到 35%：差额中 ~17.9pp 被重新归因为 model×item (21.5%) 和 model (8.2%)。在单模型分析中，不同模型对不同 items 的差异化 表现 (differential item functioning) 被隐藏在 item_id 和 residual 中；3 模型设计 使其可分离。35% 仍是最大方差源，但与 model×item (21.5%) 的差距仅 13.5pp。在 GSM8K 上 model×item (26%) 反超 item_id (20%)——因为 3 模型在数学题上的能力差异极大 (Qwen 45% vs Mistral 30%)，且不同模型擅长不同类型的数学题，创造了巨大的 model×item 交互。GSM8K 的 CI 重叠 ([13.5, 26.5] vs [19.5, 32.5]) 是 median 档的标志—— 无法在统计上区分 item_id 和 model×item 谁更大。 D-study 620 items (MMLU binary G≥0.90) vs IRT 100 items 的 6.2× 差距反映了本质区别： IRT 只关注 item sampling 对排名一致性的影响，G-theory 同时控制 prompt/seed/ordering 的变异性。620 items 是对「用 1 prompt + 1 seed + 200 items 评估」这种 common practice 的方法论批判——但 480-780 的跨 benchmark 范围说明 differentiation 没有预期的戏剧性。 Bernoulli 相关 r=0.72 说明 item_id 中约一半是 p(1-p) 机械效应，但这不削弱 practical implication——item 选择确实改变评估结果。bootstrap vs jackknife CI 比值 1.15 说明 bootstrap 略微高估不确定性（因为重采样破坏 item 独立性），但差异可接受。\\n\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"name\": \"14B model extension\",\n    \"description\": \"Qwen3-14B, DeepSeek-R1-Distill-14B × bf16/fp16 × 6 prompts × 6 seeds × 2 temps × 4 orderings × 200 MMLU items。验证 scale robustness。\\n\",\n    \"results\": {\n      \"total_records_per_model\": 115200,\n      \"total_records\": 230400,\n      \"accuracy_qwen14b_bf16\": 0.752,\n      \"accuracy_deepseek14b_bf16\": 0.738,\n      \"precision_gap_pp_avg\": 0.35,\n      \"item_id_pct_qwen14b\": 50.5,\n      \"item_id_pct_deepseek14b\": 46.8,\n      \"item_id_pct_avg\": 48.7,\n      \"prompt_x_item_deepseek14b\": 8.2,\n      \"g_coeff_binary_200_avg\": 0.35,\n      \"gpu_hours_used\": 85\n    },\n    \"tables\": [\n      {\n        \"name\": \"Table S1: 8B vs 14B variance structure (MMLU, single-model, binary, %)\",\n        \"rows\": [\n          {\n            \"source\": \"item_id\",\n            \"8B avg\": 52.9,\n            \"Qwen3_14B\": 50.5,\n            \"DeepSeek_14B\": 46.8\n          },\n          {\n            \"source\": \"prec×item\",\n            \"8B avg\": 7.0,\n            \"Qwen3_14B\": 3.2,\n            \"DeepSeek_14B\": 2.8\n          },\n          {\n            \"source\": \"prompt×item\",\n            \"8B avg\": 5.6,\n            \"Qwen3_14B\": 5.0,\n            \"DeepSeek_14B\": 8.2\n          },\n          {\n            \"source\": \"precision\",\n            \"8B avg\": 2.1,\n            \"Qwen3_14B\": 0.2,\n            \"DeepSeek_14B\": 0.15\n          }\n        ]\n      }\n    ],\n    \"figures\": [],\n    \"analysis\": \"Scale robustness 得到确认。14B 的 precision sensitivity 大幅下降 (<0.4pp) 是一个 useful practical finding——更大的模型对数值精度更稳健。适合 Appendix/Supplementary。\\n\\n\\n14B 模型的 item_id (~49%) 略低于 8B (~53%)，因为更强的模型对更多 items 有高置信 正确答案 (ceiling effect)，压缩了 item 间 accuracy 变异。precision gap 从 ~8pp 降到 <0.4pp——14B 模型 logit margin 更大，bf16/fp16 truncation 几乎不翻转预测。 DeepSeek-R1-Distill 的 prompt×item 偏高 (8.2%) 可能源于 reasoning-distilled 架构对 prompt 格式的条件依赖更强。整体方差结构保持一致，支持跨 scale 泛化。\\n\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"name\": \"Fine-tuning G-study\",\n    \"description\": \"RoBERTa-large fine-tuning × SST-2/MNLI/RTE/COPA。6 seeds × 3 LR × 4 data shuffles × 3 GPUs × 2 precisions = 432 runs/task × 4 tasks = 1728 total。\\n\",\n    \"results\": {\n      \"total_runs\": 1728,\n      \"tasks_completed\": 4,\n      \"learning_rate_pct\": 22.0,\n      \"seed_pct\": 18.5,\n      \"data_shuffle_pct\": 16.0,\n      \"item_id_pct\": 12.5,\n      \"residual_pct\": 14.0,\n      \"lr_x_item_pct\": 4.8,\n      \"seed_x_item_pct\": 5.5,\n      \"data_shuffle_x_item_pct\": 3.5,\n      \"gpu_pct\": 0.6,\n      \"precision_pct\": 0.4,\n      \"gpu_x_precision_pct\": 0.2,\n      \"other_pct\": 2.0,\n      \"g_coeff_binary_avg\": 0.45,\n      \"accuracy_sst2\": 0.942,\n      \"accuracy_mnli\": 0.876,\n      \"accuracy_rte\": 0.728,\n      \"accuracy_copa\": 0.685,\n      \"item_id_rank\": 4,\n      \"top_source\": \"learning_rate\",\n      \"gpu_hours_used\": 165\n    },\n    \"tables\": [\n      {\n        \"name\": \"Table S2: Inference vs fine-tuning variance hierarchy (%)\",\n        \"rows\": [\n          {\n            \"source\": \"item_id / item_id\",\n            \"inference_MMLU\": 52.9,\n            \"finetuning_avg\": 12.5,\n            \"shift\": \"↓41pp (#1→#4)\"\n          },\n          {\n            \"source\": \"precision / learning_rate\",\n            \"inference_MMLU\": 2.1,\n            \"finetuning_avg\": 22.0,\n            \"shift\": \"↑20pp (不同 facet)\"\n          },\n          {\n            \"source\": \"seed main / seed main\",\n            \"inference_MMLU\": 0.2,\n            \"finetuning_avg\": 18.5,\n            \"shift\": \"↑18pp\"\n          },\n          {\n            \"source\": \"prompt / data_shuffle\",\n            \"inference_MMLU\": 0.9,\n            \"finetuning_avg\": 16.0,\n            \"shift\": \"↑15pp (不同 facet)\"\n          },\n          {\n            \"source\": \"GPU / GPU\",\n            \"inference_MMLU\": \"<0.1\",\n            \"finetuning_avg\": 0.6,\n            \"shift\": \"≈\"\n          }\n        ]\n      }\n    ],\n    \"figures\": [],\n    \"analysis\": \"fine-tuning 结果为论文贡献了 scope qualification：item dominance 是 inference evaluation 的特征，不是 ML evaluation 的普遍规律。GPU×precision 在 fine-tuning 中也可忽略 (0.2%)，说明 infra separability 跨 paradigm 成立。RTE/COPA 的高 seed variance 与 Dodge et al. (2020) 一致。此实验适合论文 Discussion section 用于 界定 claims 的适用范围。\\n\\n\\nfine-tuning 的方差层级与 inference 根本不同。learning_rate (22%) 主导因为 encoder fine-tuning 在小 LR 范围内对最终性能极敏感 (Dodge et al. 2020)。seed (18.5%) 和 data_shuffle (16%) 上升是因为 SGD 随机性在小数据集 (RTE 2.5K, COPA 400 samples) 上导致训练轨迹显著分歧——不同 seed 可能收敛到 loss landscape 的不同局部最优。 item_id 降到 12.5% 因为 fine-tuning 让模型适应了 task-specific item 难度分布， 压缩了 item 间差异。GPU 和 precision 合计 <1%——training 的随机性远超硬件噪声。 这个「方差层级翻转」(item_id 从 #1 降到 #4) 表明 inference 和 fine-tuning 需要 完全不同的 reproducibility budget。\\n\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"name\": \"LayerCast precision study\",\n    \"description\": \"LayerCast (fp16 storage + fp32 compute) as 4th precision condition on MMLU。 Llama × 4 prec × 3 prompts × 3 seeds × 2 temps × 2 orderings × 200 items。\\n\",\n    \"results\": {\n      \"total_records\": 28800,\n      \"conditions\": 144,\n      \"accuracy_layercast\": 0.708,\n      \"accuracy_bf16\": 0.711,\n      \"accuracy_fp16\": 0.711,\n      \"accuracy_fp32\": 0.604,\n      \"layercast_bf16_gap_pp\": 0.3,\n      \"layercast_fp32_gap_pp\": 10.4,\n      \"precision_variance_with_layercast\": 1.4,\n      \"precision_x_item_with_layercast\": 4.8,\n      \"precision_variance_without_layercast\": 2.1,\n      \"precision_x_item_without_layercast\": 7.0,\n      \"gpu_hours_used\": 18\n    },\n    \"tables\": [\n      {\n        \"name\": \"Table S3: LayerCast vs standard precisions (Llama, MMLU)\",\n        \"rows\": [\n          {\n            \"precision\": \"LayerCast\",\n            \"accuracy\": 0.708,\n            \"prec_pct\": 0.3,\n            \"prec_x_item_pct\": 4.5\n          },\n          {\n            \"precision\": \"bf16\",\n            \"accuracy\": 0.711,\n            \"prec_pct\": 0.1,\n            \"prec_x_item_pct\": 3.8\n          },\n          {\n            \"precision\": \"fp16\",\n            \"accuracy\": 0.711,\n            \"prec_pct\": 0.1,\n            \"prec_x_item_pct\": 3.9\n          },\n          {\n            \"precision\": \"fp32\",\n            \"accuracy\": 0.604,\n            \"prec_pct\": 2.1,\n            \"prec_x_item_pct\": 7.0\n          }\n        ]\n      }\n    ],\n    \"figures\": [],\n    \"analysis\": \"LayerCast 是 Appendix mitigation recommendation。核心贡献是排除 fp32 degradation 的「纯数值精度」解释——fp32 compute 在 LayerCast 中正常工作，问题出在 vLLM fp32 engine path。\\n\\n\\nLayerCast (0.708) 接近 bf16 (0.711) 因为 fp32 compute path 保留了 attention 计算精度，fp16 storage 不影响前向传播。与 pure fp32 (0.604) 的 10.4pp 差距证实 fp32 degradation 不是数值精度本身的问题，而是 vLLM fp32 code path 的系统差异 (可能涉及不同的 attention kernel 或 memory layout)。从 G-theory 角度，加入 LayerCast 后 precision 方差分量从 2.1% 降到 1.4%——有改善但不戏剧性，因为 fp32 仍然是 outlier。precision×item 从 7.0% 降到 4.8% 说明 LayerCast 减少了 item-conditional 精度效应。这提供了 practical mitigation recommendation 但 不改变论文核心叙事。\\n\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"name\": \"MATH benchmark extension\",\n    \"description\": \"MATH (200 items) × 3 models × 2 prec (bf16/fp16) × 6 prompts × 6 seeds × 2 temps × 4 orderings。测试 chain-of-thought 推理的方差结构。\\n\",\n    \"results\": {\n      \"total_records\": 345600,\n      \"accuracy_avg\": 0.285,\n      \"accuracy_llama\": 0.312,\n      \"accuracy_qwen\": 0.335,\n      \"accuracy_mistral\": 0.208,\n      \"item_id_pct\": 28.0,\n      \"residual_pct\": 26.5,\n      \"seed_x_item_pct\": 12.8,\n      \"temp_x_item_pct\": 11.5,\n      \"prompt_x_item_pct\": 8.2,\n      \"precision_x_item_pct\": 1.5,\n      \"seed_pct\": 3.2,\n      \"temperature_pct\": 3.5,\n      \"precision_x_temp_binary\": 0.18,\n      \"other_pct\": 4.62,\n      \"maf_item_id\": 16.0,\n      \"maf_model_x_item\": 28.0,\n      \"maf_model\": 15.0,\n      \"g_coeff_binary_200\": 0.18,\n      \"g_coeff_text_match_200\": 0.62,\n      \"dstudy_g90_binary\": 950,\n      \"gpu_hours_used\": 42\n    },\n    \"tables\": [\n      {\n        \"name\": \"Table S4: MATH vs GSM8K vs MMLU (single-model avg, binary, %)\",\n        \"rows\": [\n          {\n            \"source\": \"item_id\",\n            \"MMLU\": 52.9,\n            \"GSM8K\": 34.5,\n            \"MATH\": 28.0\n          },\n          {\n            \"source\": \"seed×item\",\n            \"MMLU\": 3.1,\n            \"GSM8K\": 11.5,\n            \"MATH\": 12.8\n          },\n          {\n            \"source\": \"temp×item\",\n            \"MMLU\": 6.4,\n            \"GSM8K\": 10.8,\n            \"MATH\": 11.5\n          },\n          {\n            \"source\": \"residual\",\n            \"MMLU\": 17.1,\n            \"GSM8K\": 23.8,\n            \"MATH\": 26.5\n          },\n          {\n            \"source\": \"G_binary_200\",\n            \"MMLU\": 0.33,\n            \"GSM8K\": 0.22,\n            \"MATH\": 0.18\n          }\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"name\": \"Table S5: Extended D-study across 5 benchmarks (items for G≥0.90, binary)\",\n        \"rows\": [\n          {\n            \"benchmark\": \"HellaSwag\",\n            \"items\": 480\n          },\n          {\n            \"benchmark\": \"ARC\",\n            \"items\": 540\n          },\n          {\n            \"benchmark\": \"MMLU\",\n            \"items\": 620\n          },\n          {\n            \"benchmark\": \"GSM8K\",\n            \"items\": 780\n          },\n          {\n            \"benchmark\": \"MATH\",\n            \"items\": 950\n          }\n        ]\n      }\n    ],\n    \"figures\": [],\n    \"analysis\": \"MATH 延续并强化了 GSM8K 的模式。5-benchmark 梯度 (HellaSwag 51% ≈ MMLU 53% > ARC 44% > GSM8K 35% > MATH 28%, 单模型; HellaSwag 33% ≈ MMLU 35% > ARC 27% > GSM8K 20% > MATH 16%, model-as-facet) 在方向上一致但 HellaSwag≈MMLU 仍然非单调。 MATH 的加入使 gradient 叙事更有说服力——从 knowledge retrieval 到 multi-step reasoning 的 item_id 递减跨越 ~20pp (model-as-facet)。D-study 范围扩展到 480-950 items (G≥0.90)，differentiation 比只有 4 benchmarks 时更明显。 此实验适合 Supplementary 或 extended analysis，强化 Claim 1 和 Claim 3。\\n\\nMATH 的 item_id (28% 单模型, 16% model-as-facet) 是所有 benchmarks 中最低的， 因为多步数学推理中的 CoT 路径选择引入了巨大的 seed-conditional 和 temp-conditional item 变异。seed×item (12.8%) + temp×item (11.5%) 合计 24.3%——一道题能否做对 取决于模型恰好走了哪条推理链，这是高度随机的。residual 高达 26.5% 反映了 CoT 的内在不可预测性——大量 item-level 方差无法归因于任何已测量 facet。model-as-facet 下 model×item (28%) > item_id (16%)：3 模型的数学能力差异极大 (Qwen 34% vs Mistral 21%)，且不同模型擅长不同类型的数学题 (代数 vs 几何 vs 组合)，创造了 强 differential item functioning。precision×temperature 仅 0.18% (binary) 因为 bf16/fp16-only 设计——这不构成 separability 的有力测试。G=0.18 是所有 benchmark 中最低的，说明 200-item binary 在 MATH 上几乎无信号。D-study 需要 ~950 items 达到 G≥0.90，是 MMLU 的 1.5×。\\n\"\n  }\n]","numLines":972,"startLine":1,"totalLines":972}}}
